window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S06"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","You're probably wondering whether or not you need to use this book. If you are going to be teaching S6, then the answer is \"Yes!\" If you are a new teacher, you should read the first portion of this book very carefully. If you have been teaching for a while, it 's a useful tool for you to brush up on your teaching practices, so a quick review will sharpen your skills.","你可能在想自己是否需要用这本书。如果你要教 S6，答案是“需要！”如果你是新老师，请非常仔细地阅读本书的前半部分。如果你已经教了一段时间，这本书是帮你温习教学方法的好工具，快速浏览一遍就能让你的技巧更纯熟。",0],["h2","How To Teach S6","如何教 S6",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, which are S series(See It & Say It) and EEC series(Easy English Conversation) , for student learning English more confidently. Here are the introductions of teaching materials for S6 students:","我们有两个系列，S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），帮助学生更有自信地学英语。以下是 S6 学生教材的介绍：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 6 Classroom Activities 6A and 6B Homework Exercises 6A and 6B","Classroom Readers 6（课堂读本）　Classroom Activities 6A、6B（课堂活动）　Homework Exercises 6A、6B（家庭作业）",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets S6 consists of five books: Classroom Readers 6 , Classroom Activities 6A and 6B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 6A and 6B, (intended for home use). These sets have a three-month (24 sessions) time span in which to be completed. There are fifteen lessons, three test days, three game/activity days and three review days. This teacher's manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some type of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section of the book thoroughly before teaching Lesson 1 of the alphabet book. Methods of teaching the alphabet, phonics, classroom activities, songs and games are explained to supplement the lesson presentations, which follow.","听力练习、小测验、考试、活动单　S6 共有五本书：Classroom Readers 6、Classroom Activities 6A 和 6B（课堂使用），以及 Homework Exercises 6A 和 6B（回家使用）。这套教材要在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含十五课、三次考试日、三次游戏／活动日和三次复习日。这本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师进度、语法、沟通与发音目标。时间许可的话，每一课都应包含根据当天课程或复习前几课所设计的游戏／练习。在教字母书第 1 课之前，务必详读本书这一部分。字母、自然拼读、课堂活动、歌曲和游戏的教法都在这里说明，作为后面各课教学的补充。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: CR","● Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","The teaching functions of this book are vocabulary and short stories. It is an extremely important initial stage for the students in reading. Of course, you can see all the contents on Jordan's Website, which is a good resource for teaching and a fun way of learning English.","这本书的教学重点是单词和短篇故事，是学生阅读非常重要的起步阶段。当然，你也可以在乔登网站上看到所有内容，那是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: CA","● Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are a total of two books for the Classroom Activities :","Classroom Activities 共有两本：",0],["p","6A and 6B, which provide a variety of activities and exercises to strengthen conversation skills and reinforce grammar patterns. There is also a strong emphasis on phonetics and pronunciation to help students develop good reading and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a work book. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize Key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns.","6A 和 6B 提供各种活动和练习，加强会话能力并巩固语法句型，也非常重视音标和发音，帮助学生养成良好的阅读和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图或音标活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导来促进英语沟通，不是读本也不是作业本。空白部分是活动所需，让学生用口语说出来，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师强调重点语法／句型／问句的指引。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: HE","● Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","It is extremely convenient way to have 6A and 6B Homework Exercises for each teacher and student, because teachers need a reasonable time to correct the homework. Hence, students can do one of the books while the teachers are correcting another one. Moreover, students have a great chance to practice what they have learned form school that day by writing these books, and also teachers can easily understand their students' learning results.","每位老师和学生都有 6A、6B 两本家庭作业非常方便，因为老师需要合理的时间批改作业。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。此外，学生写这些作业能好好练习当天在学校学到的内容，老师也能轻松了解学生的学习成果。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","● Teaching Syllabus/Today's Homework","● 教学进度／今日作业",0],["p","There are totally twenty-four times for students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for filling out a Daily Progress Report Form. These forms are located in the Class Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they have already finished filling out the form, and record their performances in class.","师生共有二十四次记录每堂课的学习进度。老师负责填写每日进度报告表，这些表格在每位学生都应该有的 Class Progress Report Book（课堂进度报告本）里。学生填完表格后检查每个人的本子，并记录他们的课堂表现。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific items of learning contents are listed in this area for the teacher to check teaching points and for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. The teacher can note supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"Others.\" Put a tick in the squares for \"Excellent, \" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder,\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students","这一区列出一些具体的学习内容项目，方便老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学了什么。老师可在“Others”栏注记使用的补充教材或指派的作业。依学生表现在“Excellent”、“Good”或“Try Harder”的方格打钩。“Excellent”表示学生",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教材介绍","t":"Introduction To The Teaching Materials","k":"text","p":[3],"b":[["p","understand all the contents and are able to get use of them; \"Good\" means students can almost understand what they learned in class but not good at performing; \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and have their parents pay more attention to their kids.","理解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生大致理解课堂所学，但表现不太好；“Try Harder”表示学生需要更多协助，也请家长多关注孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher's and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This section is for the teacher and parents to communicate with each other. Also, the teacher may use this space for recording the date time, and content of make-up classes.","这一栏让老师和家长互相沟通。老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和内容。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","The teacher may write quiz grades in this space.","老师可以在这里写上小测验成绩。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","There are totally three evaluation sheets, which should be recorded in Class 9, Class 16, and Class 24 in this term. These evaluation sheets , which are for students to evaluate by themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the students have learned from the English course and also their participation in class. Before they start to do it, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Example: Good Fair Failed","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 9 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始填写前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","Here are the contents of S6 MP3 :","以下是 S6 MP3 的内容：",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 6","● Classroom Readers 6（课堂读本 6）",0],["li","● Classroom Activities 6A, 6B","● Classroom Activities 6A、6B（课堂活动 6A、6B）",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 6A, 6B","● Homework Exercises 6A、6B（家庭作业 6A、6B）",0],["li","● EEC Book 3 Lesson7-Lesson12 Teacher should introduce the new lesson or review the lesson, which has been taught by using the cassettes/CD/MP3. This will help students to be familiar with different learning experiences efficiently. Moreover, please encourage students to review or preview the lesson from listening to the cassettes/CD/MP3, and also on the touchscreen all-in-ones.","● EEC 第 3 册 第 7 课－第 12 课　老师应使用录音带／CD／MP3 介绍新课或复习教过的课，帮助学生有效熟悉不同的学习经验。此外，请鼓励学生听录音带／CD／MP3，也用触控一体机来复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/ activity of your own that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 85% on a test or quiz, he will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 85% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h3","● Spelling Quiz","● 拼写小测验",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. Have the students write the quiz words in their notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that the quiz will cover.","在热身时间针对之前教过的单词进行拼写小测验，请学生把小测验的单词写在笔记本或学习进度手册上。小测验前，老师可以先复习小测验范围的单词。",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are totally three quizzes on Class 7, Class 14 and Class 22 in this term. This is the preparation for the coming test. Students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to enhance them again. And as well, teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","● 小测验：本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 7 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。这是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会提升表现；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are totally three listening lab tests in this term, which always occurs on the formal quiz days in Class 7, Class 14 and Class 22. It's a great chance to improve students' listening comprehension by using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty to understand the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and failed. Building their confidence is the most important mission, especially in S6.","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在第 7、14、22 堂课的正式小测验日进行。利用听力录音带是提升学生听力理解的好机会。请注意学生考试时的反应，如果他们听不懂题目，请再播一次。别让学生感到挫折和失败。建立他们的信心是最重要的任务，在 S6 尤其如此。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are totally three tests in Class 8, Class 15 and Class 23 in this term. The teacher can see students' achievements from the tests. This is one of the most important standards for students whether they can promote to the highest level or not.","本学期共有三次考试，在第 8、15、23 堂课。老师可以从考试看出学生的学习成果，这也是学生能否升到最高级别最重要的标准之一。",0],["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","This is a resource for teachers teaching in class while carrying out the games or activities. Of course, students can play games or activities by using these sheets through group works, and practice what they have learned form today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily know the students' performances in class.","● 活动单：这是老师在课堂上进行游戏或活动时使用的资源。学生也可以通过分组合作，用活动单玩游戏或进行活动，同时练习当天学到的内容。此外，家长也能轻松了解孩子在课堂上的表现。",0],["h2","Easy English Conversation: EEC",null,0],["h3","●Text book","● 课本",0],["p","Book 3 Easy English Conversation Book 3 MP3 Basically, there are six books in EEC series. The idea of using these series with S series is to enhance students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are the useful and worthy conversation books. Easy English Conversation (EEC) Book Three is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary and activities. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style. EEC Book one contains three sections: Let's See and Say,","第 3 册 Easy English Conversation 第 3 册 MP3　EEC 系列基本上共有六本。搭配 S 系列使用，是为了加强学生的口语和听力能力，确实是实用又有价值的会话书。Easy English Conversation（EEC）第三册着重教孩子非常基础的英语。每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话的设计是要教西方的礼仪和说话方式。EEC 第一册包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5],"b":[["h3","Let's Check, and What Can I do?","Let's Check 和 What Can I Do?",0],["p","Each section has specific learning objectives.","每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","●Let's See And Say","● Let's See And Say",0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture to let students know what they are going to learn from it. The picture presents the meaning of the situation, which will help them understand the roles and stories well. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. Teachers should explain a situation by showing the main picture to help students understand what kind of situation it is.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，让学生知道接下来要学什么。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。",0],["h3","●Let's Check","● Let's Check",0],["p","In this section, there are listening comprehension and writing activities for students to practice, which are designed to show what students have learned from the unit. The exercise of listening comprehension is for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit .The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动让学生练习，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","●What Can I Do?","● What Can I Do?",0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class, teachers should tell the students to open their books and to finish this evaluation. First , teachers should read each item for students and explain the meaning. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain is the meaning of the list to their parents at home. Example: Good Fair Failed What Can I Do? (From Lesson 8) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can ask \" What's your address ?\" I can give my address ?\" I can spell any name. I can write any name.","这一部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应让学生打开书完成这份评估。首先，老师逐项念给学生听并解释意思。解释完后，学生依自己对表现的感受在适当的栏打钩。他们也可以回家向父母解释清单的意思。范例：Good Fair Failed What Can I Do?（取自第 8 课）Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can ask \"What's your address?\" I can give my address. I can spell any name. I can write any name.",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● Storytelling","● 说故事",0],["p","Storytelling is a good way to get your students involved in learning. Especially when using the Classroom Readers, consider these suggestions:","说故事是让学生投入学习的好方法，特别是使用 Classroom Readers 时，可以参考以下建议：",0],["li","1. Introduce the story. Show the cover of the book and teach key words in the title of the story.","1. 介绍故事：展示书的封面，教故事标题中的关键字。",0],["li","2. Tell the story using mime and gesture. Since the students are low- level learners, they will understand more of the story from your gestures.","2. 用动作和手势说故事。学生程度还不高，通过您的手势能理解更多故事内容。",0],["li","3. A picture is worth a thousand words. Let the pictures help you tell the story. After the story, do some practice to help the students learn the sentence patterns, colors, numbers, nouns, actions or animals from the story book.","3. 一张图胜过千言万语，让图片帮您说故事。说完故事后做一些练习，帮助学生学会故事书中的句型、颜色、数字、名词、动作或动物。",0],["li","4. Using \"Finger Reading\" to lead students focus on the story and learning the words of the book.","4. 用“手指指读”引导学生专注在故事上，学习书中的单词。",0],["li","5. When you read or tell the story, always refer to the written text in the book.","5. 念或说故事时，一定要对照书中的文字。",0],["li","6. Read the story more than once. If you read the story then the children will always hear exactly the same text and this will help them to predict what is to come.","6. 故事要念不只一次。如果是照书念，孩子每次都会听到完全相同的文字，这能帮助他们预测接下来的内容。",0],["li","7. The teacher must be careful not to read too quickly. Written text is usually very precise, economical, and unrepeatable. That means that listening is a fairly demanding task.","7. 老师要注意不要念得太快。书面文字通常非常精确、精简、不重复，这表示聆听是相当吃力的任务。",0],["li","8. Storybooks can be about the contents that you want to teach in the semester. When students listen to the story, the material will also relate to the lessons of the textbook and it will help the students to understand.","8. 故事书的内容可以是您这学期想教的内容。学生听故事时，内容也和课本的课程相关，能帮助学生理解。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","Teaching the children how to spell in S6 is mandatory. There really isn't any way to learn spelling other than constant repetition and drilling. Ask the students to practice spelling/study the new words at home. Call out individual students to spell the review words as you take attendance. A good method to teach it is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","在 S6 一定要教孩子拼写。除了不断反复练习，真的没有别的方法学拼写。请学生在家练习拼写／学新单词。点名时叫个别学生拼复习单词。好方法是每次介绍新单词时都照下列步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly, not in seating order. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Vocabulary","● 单词",0],["li","1. Say the word to the students, have them repeat it after you.","1. 念出单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Phonetic Spelling: See also \"How to teach spelling\"","2. 用自然拼读拼写：请参考“如何教拼写”。",0],["li","3. Explain the meaning to the students by using V.A.C. (from digital material) or situational stories. For example: When teaching \"believe\"","3. 用 V.A.C.（数字教材）或情境故事向学生解释意思。例如教 \"believe\" 时：",0],["d","(Point to S1) He says he is Spiderman. I don't believe it.","T",0],["p","Do you believe it?","Do you believe it?（你相信吗？）",0],["li","4. Make sentences by using the vocabulary.","4. 用单词造句。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S6","● S6 的综合教学法",0],["h3","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response)","1. T.P.R.（全肢体反应教学法）",0],["p","Teacher says the commands and the students show their actions by following them. Those commands are all from the classroom languages. For example: Stand up、 Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand...etc. Or teach students different vocabulary. For example: Point to the bathroom/ the bedroom.. etc. Show me \"call\"/ \"scared\"...","老师说出指令，学生照着做动作。这些指令都来自课堂用语，例如：Stand up、Sit down、Go to...、Raise your hand... 等。或教学生不同的单词，例如：Point to the bathroom / the bedroom... 等。Show me \"call\" / \"scared\"...",0],["h3","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept)","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）",0],["p","The best way to help students to understand the meaning of English is to use pictures, flashcards, objects, gestures, and other tools to teach in class. These teaching methods will heighten students' interest in English learning.","帮助学生理解英语意思最好的方法，是在课堂上用图片、单词卡、实物、手势和其他工具教学。这些教学方法能提高学生学英语的兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","This is a common way for teaching in class, but it's very useful.","这是课堂上常用的教学方式，但非常有用。",0],["d","everything","T",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have the students practice sentence patterns in turns while passing the flashcards.","让学生传单词卡，轮流练习句型。",0],["d","Are they playing?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","Ss",0],["d","Are they playing?","S1",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","S2",0],["d","Are they playing?","S3",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","The teacher throws the ball to the students and plays music. The students pass the ball to the music. Once the music stops, everyone has to stop passing the ball and look at the teacher. The teacher shows a flashcard or points to the monitor. The student with the ball in his hand must say the sentence. This activity can also be done with two balls. Have two teams compete; it's more exciting.","老师把球丢给学生并播放音乐，学生随着音乐传球。音乐一停，大家都要停止传球并看着老师。老师展示一张单词卡或指着屏幕，拿着球的学生必须说出句子。这个活动也可以用两颗球进行，让两队比赛会更刺激。",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","yesterday today tomorrow bake cake ● cook soup watch TV go shopping Use a sticky ball. Have a student throw it at any square, and then make a sentence according to the square.","yesterday today tomorrow bake cake ● cook soup watch TV go shopping　用黏黏球，让学生丢向任一格，再依那一格造句。",0],["d","What is Jenny doing?","T",0],["d","She is drinking.","S",0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write a sentence pattern on the board. For example: These are . T (show one of the flashcards: shirts, and have Ss finish the sentence)","在黑板上写一个句型，例如：These are ___. T（展示一张单词卡：shirts，请学生完成句子）",0],["d","They are shirts.","Ss",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["p","Divide the students into many groups and have them practice the dialogue or conversation. Classroom Activities Lesson 13 \"Peter's Family\" is a suitable topic for role-play.","- 把学生分成许多组练习对话。Classroom Activities 第 13 课“Peter's Family”很适合做角色扮演。",0],["h3","9. Cloze","9. 克漏字",0],["p","Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have the students fill in the blanks. Cloze is often used to practice the verb \"to be.\" (For example: I Am, He is, You are).","把句子中的几个关键字拿掉，让学生填空。克漏字常用来练习 be 动词（例如：I am、He is、You are）。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","You can do a bit of Question & Answer at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. You may also ask students some questions while using the Classroom Readers. Try to be a storyteller, and have the students enjoy your story. After the story, ask them some questions to make sure they understand.","每堂课开始时可以进行 5–10 分钟的问与答。使用 Classroom Readers 时也可以问学生一些问题。试着当一位说故事的人，让学生享受您的故事；讲完故事后问学生一些问题，确认他们都懂了。",0],["h3","11. Matching","11. 配对",0],["p","Classroom Activities Lesson 11 is just right to practice Matching. After talking about the characters, the teacher can choose one of the characters, and have the students make sentences about the character's facial features, etc, For example:","课堂活动第 11 课正适合练习配对。谈完人物后，老师可以选一个人物，让学生用句子描述这个人物的五官特征等，例如：",0],["d","Mike Monkey.","T",0],["d","Mike Monkey's eyes are blue.","Ss",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","This is an effective way to practice English. The students will learn about food items in this level. The teacher can let the students come up with many foods according to a topic. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。学生在这一级会学到食物，老师可以请学生依照主题想出很多食物。例如：",0],["d","Let's think of some words that are related to fast food.","T",0],["d","sandwich, hamburger, apple pie....","Ss",0],["p","The teacher can find some related resources in Jordan's website.","老师可以在乔登网站上找到一些相关资源。",0],["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","This drill is good for practicing tenses. Since the students have learned the present tense and the present continuous tense, the teacher can say a sentence and have the students change the tense.","这个练习很适合练习时态。学生已经学过现在时和现在进行时，老师可以说一个句子，请学生改变它的时态。",0],["d","I am playing in the park.","T",0],["d","You play in the park.","S",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the contents of the lessons to help students understand the meaning of English exactly and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生确实了解英语的意思，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","● Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All the contents of S6 are on Jordan's Website. They include Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises, and EEC Book 3. Students will have a lot of fun learning English while watching and working with the animated pictures on this web site. Please encourage the students to practice English with the MP3 in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, and Review are three important","S6 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括课堂读本、课堂活动、家庭作业和 EEC 第 3 册。学生在网站上一边看一边操作动画，会学得很开心。请鼓励学生在课堂上和家里用 MP3 练习英语。预习、辅助和复习是数字教学三个重要的",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[6,7],"b":[["p","aspects of digital teaching. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to use.","面向。它是高科技的多媒体，但很容易使用。",0],["h3","● How to visit Jordan's Website","● 如何进入乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ▼ 乔登美语教学网 ▼ e-Learning ▼ e-Learning白金会员▼▼ ▼ Enter the password ▼ Big Kid 大儿童学习区▼▼▼ ▼ Lesson IV▼儿童进阶▼▼ ▼ S6",null,0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1. Classroom Commands","1. 课堂指令",0],["p","I knew you could do it! Yippee! All right! Hand in your homework, please! Are you sure? Be careful! Notice your spelling! Notice the tense!","我就知道你做得到！耶！太好了！请交作业！你确定吗？小心！注意拼写！注意时态！",0],["h3","2. Classroom Interaction","2. 课堂互动用语",0],["p","How do you say.......? What's the past tense of...? Make a sentence with..... Make a question. Who can correct the error? What does ..... mean? How do you spell... in alphabets? How do you spell .... in IPA symbols? Am I clear? Do you understand? Pardon me. How do you pronounce the word? Don't give up! You can do it! That's OK. Take easy. Try it again! Give me five! Go! Good Luck!!","……怎么说？……的过去时是什么？用……造句。提一个问题。谁能改正这个错误？……是什么意思？……用字母怎么拼？……用国际音标怎么拼？我说清楚了吗？你们懂吗？请再说一次。这个字怎么念？别放弃！你做得到！没关系，放轻松。再试一次！击个掌！开始！祝你好运！",0],["li","● The following phrases and expressions should be encourage future success and accomplishment:","● 下列短语和说法能鼓励学生日后的成功与成就：",0],["h2","How To Manage Your Class","班级管理",0],["h3","Class Preparation","课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at School thirty minutes earlier to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare Teaching Materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on Jordan's Website and get familiar with today's lesson by operating the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help the absent student make up the missing class","- 协助缺席的学生补课",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes earlier to get everything done, and also interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Check the touchscreen all-in-one is ready for the coming class.","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。",0],["li","-Get students Homework Exercise Books.","- 拿出学生的家庭作业本。",0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc. ... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best. Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behaviors. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The student should know that the teacher likes them, but only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。秩序管理：老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["li","-A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention.","- 秩序不好的班级通常是无聊的班级。快速的节奏有助于让学生保持专注。",0],["li","-Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving.","- 把教具和教材准备在手边，避免拖延太久，让学生有机会开始捣蛋。",0],["li","-Call on students in a random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention.","- 随机点学生。如果学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。",0],["li","-Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let them know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the student well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you used to don't approve of their actions.","- 全班齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习交替进行。可能的话，经常变换练习方式，保持新鲜感和变化。最后回到全班练习，延伸／巩固本课内容。时间不够时，尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，先盯着他看久一点，或拍拍他的肩膀，让他知道您不认同。如果学生仍然继续，请他停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或请他站起来。最后，如果学生还是不停止，请他到教室外找行政人员，并通知家长学生的行为。每一步之后都要好好对待这位学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是您不认同他的行为。",0],["h2","New students in Your Class","班上的新学生",0],["p","Sometimes there would be new student to your class. You should introduce the new students to your class and give everyone a chance to introduce their own. The teacher should help the new student to join the class smoothly by giving him/her some extra help and explaining your class rules clearly to the new ones. In some cases, giving the new student a chance to proof his/her English ability is a good way for the class to accept him/her. It's also a chance to eliminate his/her fear of getting in a new class.","有时班上会有新同学加入。你应该向全班介绍新同学，并让每个人都有机会自我介绍。老师应多给新同学一些协助，清楚说明班规，帮助他／她顺利融入班级。有些情况下，给新同学一个展现英语能力的机会，是让全班接纳他／她的好方法，也能消除他／她进入新班级的恐惧。",0],["h3","● Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, this is a very important process for the very beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","How to help the beginners doing homework successfully?","以下是帮助初学者",0],["h3","here are some tips","顺利完成作业的一些秘诀：",0],["li","1. Make full use of \"Reinforcement\" section of lesson plan in each class. Have students open the Homework Exercises to preview all the items about today's lesson.","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分。请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。",0],["li","2. Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT.A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","2. 清楚说明今天 Homework Exercises 的内容，让学生了解，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用等第（A、B、C 等），请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["p","90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D",null,0],["h3","Quiz And Test","小测验与考试",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/activity of your own (see games/activities section for suggestions) that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 80% on a test or quiz, he/she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 80% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed \"Telephone Teaching Material (TTM)\" to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should grade students responses by using the \"ABC\" scoring system, write comments in the \"Teacher's Handbook\", and, for encouragement, give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. For doing well on telephone teaching, the teacher may lead students to prepare those questions in class and give students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. In addition, while doing Telephone Teaching, be sure to greet students at the beginning of a conversation and give students some encouragement after they answer each question. Procedures:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，把评语写在“教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）”中，并在下次上课时依照表现给予奖励卡作为鼓励。为了让电话教学顺利，老师可以在课堂上带学生准备这些问题，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。此外，进行电话教学时，对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["p","1.G reetings: Say hello to students or their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon, good evening.",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today? 90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today?　评分：90–100 A、80–90 B、70–80 C、60–70 D",0],["h3","2.Questions and Answers","2. 问与答",0],["p","Try to encourage students to answer with complete sentences.","尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl!",null,0],["li","3. Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to let your parent sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",null,0],["li","(5) How was school today?",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[8],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[9],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. Able to listen, speak, read and write the questions, positive and negative sentences of \"will be\" future tense form of be verbs..","1. 能听、说、读、写 be 动词将来时 \"will be\" 的问句、肯定句和否定句。",0],["li","2. Able to listen, speak, read and write the questions, positive and negative sentences of verbs in future tense.","2. 能听、说、读、写动词将来时的问句、肯定句和否定句。",0],["li","3. Able to use regular verb present tense.","3. 能使用规则动词的现在时。",0],["li","4. Able to use irregular verb present tense.","4. 能使用不规则动词的现在时。",0],["li","5. Able to tell and use present continuous sentences.","5. 能说出并使用现在进行时句子。",0],["li","6. Able to use adverbs indicating time.","6. 能使用表示时间的副词。",0],["li","7. Able to use the pronouns correctly.","7. 能正确使用代词。",0],["h2","B) Communication Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. Able to say out things that are done in specific period of time.","1. 能说出在特定时间做的事。",0],["li","2. Able to say out the names of common locations in town.","2. 能说出镇上常见地点的名称。",0],["li","3. Able to say out the personal preferences, 'I like...\"","3. 能说出个人喜好：\"I like...\"",0],["li","4. Able to analyze phonetic composition of simple words.","4. 能分析简单单词的发音组成。",0],["li","5. Able to spell vocabulary.","5. 能拼出单词。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: party, asks, must, cheeseburger, French fries, milkshake, apple pie, sundae Class 2: has, have, present, forget, us, come back, cold, fever, toothache, headache, measles. Class 3: hills, want, another, quiet, hooray, walkman, puppy, radio, watch, camera. Class 9: Mom, Harry Perkins, early, late, both. play basketball, take tests, study computers, get up early, sleep late. Class 10: kitchen, honey, birthday, soon, party, terrific, tell. sweep the floor, wash the car , clean my room, help my mother, put away the toys. Class 11: lesson, January, answers, February, ringing, Alice, Simon, January, February, March. Class 12: plums, when, September, kid, let's, let us. July, August, September, October, November, December. Class 13: video, winter, welcome, ice skates, summer, push, button spring, summer, fall, winter. Class 18: neat, will, hear, fly, wrong, ouch, invisible, will not=won't. tomorrow morning, tomorrow afternoon, tomorrow night, the day after tomorrow. Class 19: Kick, Miss Meany, mean, idea. listen to music, go to the beach, visit friends, buy some new clothes. Class 20: take off, glasses, chocolate, cookies, fly, flying. borrow a book, mail a letter, see the doctor, buy chocolate cookies. Class 21: other living room, move, ghost, anything, rest. steak, pork chops, seafood, salad.",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[10,11,12,13],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions using \"have\" or \"has\"","- 用 \"have\" 或 \"has\" 问答问题",1],["li","- To learn the names of different types of fast food","- 学习各种快餐的名称",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking about people","- 询问关于别人的事",1],["li","- Making guesses","- 做猜测",1],["li","- Complimenting on others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Shrugging the shoulders","- 耸肩",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 1","课堂活动 6A 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","cheeseburger, French fries, milkshake, apple pie, sundae",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______like______? A: _____like/likes_____. IPA [ɜː], [ə]",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flashcards, a sticky ball, fast food from McDonald's, some candy","单词卡、黏黏球、麦当劳快餐、一些糖果",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1","Classroom Readers 第 1 课",1],["h3","new Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","part, asks, must, for",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______like______? A: _____like/likes_____.",null,1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 7","EEC 3 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bike, bridge, fountain, slide, seesaw, swing, sand box, scooter",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Who are they?","A",1],["d","I don't know.","B",1],["d","They seem happy.","A",1],["d","Oh, yeah? You know why?","B",1],["d","Perhaps they just won a game.","A",1],["d","Maybe they hit the lottery.","B",1],["d","Come on. You have such an imagination.","A",1],["d","I sure do.","B",1],["h2","Introduction to level 6 (5 mins)","Level 6 介绍（5 分钟）",0],["li","(1) If this is a new class, then take some time to get to know all of the students. Ask them to stand in front of the class and introduce themselves to you in a few sentences.","(1) 如果是新班级，花点时间认识所有学生。请他们站到全班面前，用几句话向你自我介绍。",0],["li","(2) Review some of the key vocabulary and grammar points from level 5, as well as the vocabularies.","(2) 复习 Level 5 的一些重要单词和语法重点。",0],["li","(3) Do a small pop quiz to see how much they still remember from the last level.","(3) 做个小小的随堂测验，看看他们还记得多少上一级的内容。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (45 mins) Lesson 1 At McDonald's a","课堂活动（45 分钟）第 1 课 At McDonald's（在麦当劳）——一家",0],["h3","fast food restaurant","快餐餐厅",0],["h2","1.1",null,0],["li","(1) Take out the food you have bought from the fast food restaurant McDonald's and show the students what you have.","(1) 拿出你从麦当劳买来的食物给学生看。",0],["li","(2) As you take out each item from the bag, say the name of the food and ask students to repeat after you. Keep going until all the food have been taken out from of the bag and students have practiced saying the names of the different types of fast food.","(2) 从袋子里一样一样拿出食物时，说出食物名称并让学生跟着念。一直到全部拿完，学生都练习说过各种快餐的名称。",0],["li","(3) Play the \"throwing-matching\" game using the sticky ball.","(3) 用黏黏球玩“丢球配对”游戏。",0],["li","- Draw pictures on the board for all the vocabulary words. Students must try to say a vocabulary word while throwing the sticky ball to the equivalent at the picture of that word on the board. Whoever can do so may get the food they call out. Do a few rounds until all the food is given out. Give candy to those who didn't get anything so they won't get too upset with the game.","- 在白板上画出所有单词的图。学生要一边说出单词，一边把黏黏球丢向白板上那个字的图。做到的人可以得到他喊出的食物。玩几轮直到食物发完。没拿到的学生给他们糖果，免得他们因为游戏太难过。",0],["li","- The students who can pronounce the vocabulary words correctly and hit the picture drawn on the wall with the sticky ball, gets some of that food. Continue this game until all of the food is gone, making sure everyone gets some.","- 单词发音正确又用黏黏球打中墙上图片的学生，可以得到一些那种食物。继续游戏直到食物发完，确保每个人都拿到一些。",0],["li","(4) Introduce the stars of this book. The students should know them from level 5.","(4) 介绍这本书的主角。学生应该从 Level 5 就认识他们了。",0],["h2","1.2-A",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the sentence pattern: \"Do you like _____?\" & \"Does ____ like ____?\"","(1) 介绍句型：\"Do you like _____?\" 和 \"Does ____ like ____?\"",0],["li","(2) Ask the class to read questions 1-6 and explain to them how to use \"like/likes\". Before you go on, make sure the class have a basic understanding of the sentence pattern.","(2) 让全班念第 1–6 题，并解释 \"like/likes\" 的用法。继续之前，确定全班对句型有基本的了解。",0],["li","(3) Play \"shooting the pig\" game using sticky ball.","(3) 用黏黏球玩“射小猪”游戏。",0],["li","- Separate the class into 3 or 4 teams depending on the size of your class. Also, tell them that they will stay as with the same people on the same team for the entire class as a team.","- 依班级人数把全班分成 3 或 4 队，并告诉他们整堂课都维持同一队。",0],["li","- Try to draw a funny looking pig with all the body parts and assign different \"positive\" points to the different body parts. Other white areas on the board can be minus \"negative\"points just to make the game more interesting.","- 画一只有完整身体部位的滑稽小猪，在不同部位标上不同的加分。白板上其他空白处可以是扣分，让游戏更有趣。",0],["li","- Teacher then aAsk each team questions that are related to the lesson. goal sentence pattern. If the team could answers the question correctly, then the team gets a chance to one member of that team may throw the sticky ball (act as a bullet) to at the pig. The team gets certain points receives or has points taken away according to the area they hit. the pig.","- 老师接着问各队和本课目标句型相关的问题。答对的队伍可以派一位队员把黏黏球（当作子弹）丢向小猪，依打中的部位加分或扣分。",0],["li","- You can also use the picture on page 6 and the chart on page 8.","- 也可以用第 6 页的图和第 8 页的表。",0],["li","- Play until the students know how to use \"like/likes\".","- 玩到学生会用 \"like/likes\" 为止。",0],["h2","1.2-B",null,0],["li","(1) Practice the 2 example questions and check to see that they understand. Practice using the two examples to make sure the students understand.","(1) 用两个例题练习，确定学生都懂。",0],["li","(2) With the Using the same teams, from the game ask the class to have a race on to see which team can finish the exercise first without making any mistake. The fastest team may get some receives moreadditional points.","(2) 用游戏中的同样队伍，让全班比赛哪一队最先完成练习而且没有错误。最快的队伍可以得到额外加分。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the questions together and ask different teams to read the answers out loud the answers.","(3) 一起讲评所有题目，请不同队伍大声念出答案。",0],["h2","1.3-A",null,0],["li","(1) Write the IPA symbols on the board.","(1) 在白板上写出国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Have the students repeat after the teacher you","(2) 让学生跟着你念。",0],["li","(3) Take your time to make sure they can all pronounce the sounds correctly.","(3) 慢慢来，确定大家都能正确发出这些音。",0],["li","(4) Draw thea chart on the board and ask each team to pronounce the sounds. More points may be given to the team(s) that can pronounce all the sounds without mistakes.","(4) 在白板上画表格，请各队念出这些音。能全部念对的队伍可以多加分。",0],["h2","1.3-B",null,0],["li","(1) Ask the students to close their books and on the board write down the IPA symbols on the board for those 4 words in the exercise.","(1) 让学生合上书，在白板上写出练习中那 4 个字的国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Students who can pronounce all 4 words may get some points for their team.","(2) 能念出全部 4 个字的学生可以为自己的队伍加分。",0],["h2","1.3-C",null,0],["li","(1) Teacher Pronounces the sounds of each word and ask the students to match the IPA symbol to the correct word.","(1) 老师念出每个字的音，让学生把国际音标和正确的字配对。",0],["li","(2) Go over the answers together and ask different teams to give the answertell the answers to the teacher.","(2) 一起讲评答案，请不同队伍说出答案。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.1","活动单 1",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 1","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 1 课",0],["h3","Horrible Is Worried","Horrible Is Worried（Horrible 很担心）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the vocabularies vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask students to repeat after teacher for the correct pronunciations. Use the touchscreen all-in-one to introduce the new vocabulary. Practice pronunciation by having the students repeat. Make sure they are pronouncing the words correctly.","(1) 用触控一体机介绍新单词，让学生跟着念来练习发音，确定他们发音正确。",0],["li","(2) Show the story in the touchscreen all-in-one to students using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask them not to look at the book but try to listen to the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask them to listen to the touchscreen all-in-one instead of looking at the book.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看故事。请他们不要看书，而是专心听触控一体机。",0],["li","(3) Repeat the story, again but this time, stop the touchscreen all-in-one after every sentence. Ask the students to say the sentence like it is said as in the touchscreen all-in-one Ask the students to repeat the sentences after the touchscreen all-in-one, then go on to the next sentence.","(3) 再播一次故事，这次每句都停下来，让学生跟着触控一体机念句子，再进到下一句。",0],["li","(4) Now open the book and aAsk each team to read out the story using the book. The team that reads the best may get some receives points.","(4) 现在打开书，请各队用书念出故事。念得最好的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(5) Ask a few questions regarding to about the story to find out if they really understand the story. Ask the students some questions to see if they understood the story.","(5) 问学生几个关于故事的问题，看看他们是否真的理解故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson seven. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below.","老师让学生听第七课“Let's See and Say”的独白来引入本课。老师可以念出或用 MP3 播放下面的独白给全班听。",0],["h3","Monolog Of Let's See And Say","Let's See And Say 独白",0],["p","The people in the park look happy. Why do they look happy? Can you guess? Let's listen to the conversation about what the two friends think happen to the people.","公园里的人看起来很开心。他们为什么看起来很开心？你猜得到吗？我们来听听两个朋友对这些人发生了什么事的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, The teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have some kind of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have ask the students to copy those items into their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到他们的进度报告上。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities"]],[38,["Lesson 1"]],[45,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1"]],[70,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1","Learning"]],[98,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At McDonald's a"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[14,15,16,17],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions using \"have\" and \"has\"","- 用 \"have\" 和 \"has\" 问答问题",1],["li","- To learn the names of different illness","- 学习各种疾病的名称",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking about people","- 询问关于别人的事",1],["li","- Making guesses","- 做猜测",1],["li","- Complimenting on others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Shrugging the shoulders","- 耸肩",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 2","课堂活动 6A 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","cold, fever, toothache, headache, measles",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______have______? A: Yes/No, ______have/has_____. IPA [h], [j]",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards, a sticky ball","单词卡、黏黏球",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","has, have, present, forget, us, come back",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______have______? A: Yes/No, ______have/has_____.",null,1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 7","EEC 3 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bike, bridge, fountain, slide, seesaw, swing, sand box, scooter",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Who are they?","A",1],["d","I don't know.","B",1],["d","They seem happy.","A",1],["d","Oh, yeah? You know why?","B",1],["d","Perhaps they just won a game.","A",1],["d","Maybe they hit the lottery.","B",1],["d","Come on. You have such an imagination.","A",1],["d","I sure do.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class by the digital teaching. Have students see the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课。让学生看触控一体机并跟着念句子。",0],["li","(2) Review the vocabularies from the last class.","(2) 复习上一堂课的单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (45 mins) Lesson 2","课堂活动（45 分钟）第 2 课",0],["h3","We Don't Feel Good","We Don't Feel Good（我们不舒服）",0],["h2","2.1",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce new vocabularies, have students repeat after teacher for several times.","(1) 介绍新单词，让学生跟着老师念几次。",0],["li","(2) Play \"throwing-matching\" game using the sticky ball.","(2) 用黏黏球玩“丢球配对”游戏。",0],["li","- Draw pictures on the board for all the words. Students must try to say a vocabulary while throwing the sticky ball to the equivalent picture on the board. If landed on the correct word then reward cards may be given to the students.","- 在白板上画出所有单词的图。学生要一边说出单词，一边把黏黏球丢向白板上对应的图。打中正确的字就可以发奖励卡给学生。",0],["h2","2.2-A",null,0],["li","(1) Write sentence 1 one the board and ask if anyone knew what the sentence means? Let the students think for a bit first and then explain the concept.","(1) 把第 1 句写在白板上，问有没有人知道这句的意思。先让学生想一下，再解释概念。",0],["li","(2) Put the class into a few groups and ask each group to read out some sentences from this section.","(2) 把全班分成几组，请每组念出这一部分的几个句子。",0],["li","(3) Ask the class if they knew how to use \"has/have\". If not then explain again.","(3) 问全班是否知道 \"has/have\" 的用法。如果不知道就再解释一次。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into 3 or 4 teams and ask each team to think of at least 2 questions of \"have/has\" to ask the other teams. When a team can ask or answer a question correctly then points may be given to the team.","(4) 把全班分成 3 或 4 队，请每队想出至少 2 个 \"have/has\" 的问题去问其他队。问或答正确的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(5) Review the sentence pattern again to conclude the game.","(5) 再复习一次句型作为游戏的结尾。",0],["h2","2.2-B",null,0],["li","(1) Read out loud the example question and do question 1 together to see if they understood.","(1) 大声念出例题，一起做第 1 题，看看他们是否理解。",0],["li","(2) With the same team assign question 2-4 to different teams and have the students discuss among themselves on how to ask and answer the question.","(2) 用同样的队伍，把第 2–4 题分给不同的队伍，让学生自己讨论如何问答。",0],["li","(3) Let each team write out the answers on the board then discuss together to see if there is any mistake.","(3) 让每队把答案写在白板上，再一起讨论有没有错误。",0],["h2","2.3-A",null,0],["li","(1) Write down the IPA symbols on the board.","(1) 在白板上写出国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Have students repeat after the teacher","(2) 让学生跟着老师念。",0],["li","(3) Take your time to make sure they can all pronounce the sound correctly.","(3) 慢慢来，确定大家都能正确发音。",0],["li","(4) Draw the chart on the board and ask each team to pronounce the sounds. More points may be given to the team(s) that can pronounce all the sounds without mistake.","(4) 在白板上画表格，请各队念出这些音。能全部念对的队伍可以多加分。",0],["h2","2.3-B",null,0],["li","(1) Ask students to close their book and on the board write down the IPA for those 4 words in the exercise.","(1) 让学生合上书，在白板上写出练习中那 4 个字的国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Students who can pronounce all 4 words may get some points for their team.","(2) 能念出全部 4 个字的学生可以为自己的队伍加分。",0],["li","(3) You can also think of some other words with the beginning sound of the two IPA symbols.","(3) 你也可以想一些以这两个国际音标开头的其他单词。",0],["h2","2.3-C",null,0],["li","(1) Teacher pronounces the sounds of each word and ask students to write the correct IPA symbols.","(1) 老师念出每个字的音，让学生写出正确的国际音标。",0],["li","(2) When finish reading all the words pick out some students to write out the answers on the board.","(2) 念完所有字后，挑几位学生到白板上写出答案。",0],["li","(3) Check all the answers and do a final review on the two new IPA symbols.","(3) 检查所有答案，最后复习这两个新的国际音标。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 2","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 2 课",0],["h2","Don't Forget Us, Horrible!","Don't Forget Us, Horrible!（别忘了我们，Horrible！）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the vocabularies using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask students to repeat after teacher for the correct pronunciations.","(1) 用触控一体机介绍单词，让学生跟着老师念以练习正确发音。",0],["li","(2) Show the story in the touchscreen all-in-one to students. Ask them not to look at the book but try to listen to the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看故事。请他们不要看书，而是专心听触控一体机。",0],["li","(3) Repeat the story again but this time stop the touchscreen all-in-one after every sentence. Ask the students to say the sentence as in the touchscreen all-in-one then go on to the next sentence.","(3) 再播一次故事，这次每句都停下来，让学生照触控一体机念出句子，再进到下一句。",0],["li","(4) Now open the book and ask each team to read out the story. The team that reads the best may get some points.","(4) 现在打开书，请各队念出故事。念得最好的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(5) Ask a few questions regarding to the story to find out if they really understand the story.","(5) 问几个关于故事的问题，看看他们是否真的理解故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and repeat the following intonation contour","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour>\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teachers can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","Do you like to play in the park? What do you like to do there? We can go for a walk, ride a bike and play on a see-saw. Please turn to page 30. Let's Check. Listen and circle.","你喜欢在公园玩吗？你喜欢在那里做什么？我们可以散步、骑自行车、玩跷跷板。请翻到第 30 页。Let's Check。听一听，圈出来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(1) Exercise: Connect the objects to the suitable verb","(1) 练习：把物品和适当的动词连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have some kind of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material # 1","电话教学教材 #1",0],["li","1. Do you like ?","1. Do you like ?（你喜欢……吗？）",0],["li","2. Does your like ?","2. Does your like ?（你的……喜欢……吗？）",0],["li","3. How do you spell \"party\"?","3. How do you spell \"party\"?（\"party\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","4. Does Ricky like hamburgers? (Yes)","4. Does Ricky like hamburgers? (Yes)（Ricky 喜欢汉堡吗？）",0],["li","5. Does Spooky like milkshakes? (No) PS. Teachers can use new words into the blanks.","5. Does Spooky like milkshakes? (No)（Spooky 喜欢奶昔吗？）附注：老师可以把新单词填进空格。",0]],"g":[[32,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1"]],[42,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2"]],[52,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2"]],[66,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 2","Learning"]],[100,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[18,19,20],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions using \"want\" or \"wants\"","- 用 \"want\" 或 \"wants\" 问答问题",1],["li","- To learn the names of different presents","- 学习各种礼物的名称",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking about people","- 询问关于别人的事",1],["li","- Making guesses","- 做猜测",1],["li","- Complimenting on others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Shrugging the shoulders","- 耸肩",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 3","课堂活动 6A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","walkman, puppy, radio, watch, camera",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______want______? A: Yes/No, _____want/wants_____. IPA [aɪ]",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards","单词卡",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 3","Classroom Readers 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","hills, want, another, quiet, hooray",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Q: Do/Does_______want______? A: Yes/No, _____want/wants_____.",null,1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 7","EEC 3 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bike, bridge, fountain, slide, seesaw, swing, sand box, scooter",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Who are they?","A",1],["d","I don't know.","B",1],["d","They seem happy.","A",1],["d","Oh, yeah? You know why?","B",1],["d","Perhaps they just won a game.","A",1],["d","Maybe they hit the lottery.","B",1],["d","Come on. You have such an imagination.","A",1],["d","I sure do.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5 mins)","热身 Warm Up（5 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class by the digital teaching. Have students see the touchscreen all-in-one and 0repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课。让学生看触控一体机并跟着念句子。",0],["li","(2) Quickly review last class's vocabularies. You pick out some students to write on the board or ask the class to pronounce then spell out the word together.","(2) 快速复习上一堂课的单词。挑几位学生到白板上写，或让全班一起念出并拼出单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["li","(4) After collecting the quiz go over all the vocabularies again.","(4) 收回小测验后，再把所有单词复习一遍。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (45 mins) Lesson 3 It's Christmas!","课堂活动（45 分钟）第 3 课 It's Christmas!（圣诞节到了！）",0],["h2","3.1",null,0],["li","(1) Do a little bit of brain storming - Ask what they would think of when the word \"presents\" comes out of their head.","(1) 做一点头脑风暴——问学生听到 \"presents\"（礼物）这个字时会想到什么。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the vocabularies and tell students those are the things each character wants.","(2) 介绍单词，告诉学生这些是每个角色想要的东西。",0],["li","(3) Have students repeat after teacher to pronounce the words correctly.","(3) 让学生跟着老师念，把字念正确。",0],["h2","3.2-A",null,0],["li","(1) Introduce the sentence pattern: Do/Does_______want______? Yes/No, _____want/wants_____.","(1) 介绍句型：Do/Does_______want______? Yes/No, _____want/wants_____.",0],["li","(2) Split the class into two teams and ask each team to read one sentence each until all sentences are read.","(2) 把全班分成两队，请每队轮流各念一句，直到所有句子念完。",0],["li","(3) Play \"telephone line\" game","(3) 玩“传话”游戏",0],["li","- Pick out some sentences from the book or make up some \"want/wants\" sentences. Whisper to the first person of both teams and tell them to whisper down the line of their team. The team that can first pass the sentence quietly and correctly to the last person may get some points.","- 从书中挑几个句子或自编一些 \"want/wants\" 的句子。悄悄告诉两队的第一个人，让他们沿着队伍悄悄传下去。最先安静又正确把句子传到最后一人的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(4) Review the sentence pattern again to conclude the game.","(4) 再复习一次句型作为游戏的结尾。",0],["h2","3.2-B",null,0],["li","(1) Practice the example question and question 2 together. Check to see that they understand.","(1) 一起练习例题和第 2 题，确定他们都懂。",0],["li","(2) With the same team from the game ask the class to have a race on which team can finish the exercise first without making any mistake. The fastest team may get some more points.","(2) 用游戏中的同样队伍，让全班比赛哪一队最先完成练习而且没有错误。最快的队伍可以多加分。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the questions together and ask different teams to read out the answers.","(3) 一起讲评所有题目，请不同队伍念出答案。",0],["h2","3.3-A",null,0],["li","(1) Write down the IPA symbols on the board.","(1) 在白板上写出国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Have students repeat after the teacher","(2) 让学生跟着老师念。",0],["li","(3) Take your time to make sure they can all pronounce the sound correctly.","(3) 慢慢来，确定大家都能正确发音。",0],["li","(4) Draw the chart on the board but only fill in the consonauts and the vowels. Have students from both team to come up and fill in and pronounce the sounds. Points may be given to the correct ones.","(4) 在白板上画表格，但只填入辅音和元音。让两队学生上来填写并念出音。正确的可以加分。",0],["li","(5) Ask the whole class to read the chart again.","(5) 让全班再念一次表格。",0],["h2","3.3-B",null,0],["li","(1) Ask students to close their book and on the board write down the IPA for those 4 words in the exercise.","(1) 让学生合上书，在白板上写出练习中那 4 个字的国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Students who can pronounce all 4 words may get some points for their team.","(2) 能念出全部 4 个字的学生可以为自己的队伍加分。",0],["h2","3.3-C",null,0],["li","(1) Teacher pronounces the sounds of each word and ask students to put a check on the words that have the[aɪ]sound.","(1) 老师念出每个字的音，让学生在有[aɪ]音的字上打钩。",0],["li","(2) Go over the answers together and ask both teams to tell the answers to the teacher.","(2) 一起讲评答案，请两队向老师说出答案。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (25 mins) Lesson 3","课堂读本（25 分钟）第 3 课",0],["h2","Horrible Is the Best!","Horrible Is the Best!（Horrible 最棒了！）",0],["li","(1) Introduce the vocabularies using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask students to repeat after teacher for the correct pronunciations.","(1) 用触控一体机介绍单词，让学生跟着老师念以练习正确发音。",0],["li","(2) Show the story in the touchscreen all-in-one to students. Ask them not to look at the book but try to listen to the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机给学生看故事。请他们不要看书，而是专心听触控一体机。",0],["li","(3) Repeat the story again but this time stop the touchscreen all-in-one after every sentence. Ask the students to say the sentence as in the touchscreen all-in-one then go on to the next sentence.","(3) 再播一次故事，这次每句都停下来，让学生照触控一体机念出句子，再进到下一句。",0],["li","(4) Now open the book and ask each team to read out the story. The team that reads the best may get some points.","(4) 现在打开书，请各队念出故事。念得最好的队伍可以得分。",0],["li","(5) Ask a few questions regarding to the story to find out if they really understand the story.","(5) 问几个关于故事的问题，看看他们是否真的理解故事。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have some kind of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[32,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[42,["Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3","大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3"]],[64,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[79,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["It's Christmas!"],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[21,22,23],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To ask and answer questions using a combination of like/likes, have/has, want/wants","综合使用 like/likes、have/has、want/wants 问答问题",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Making reminders","- 提醒别人",1],["li","- Asking for/ Saying one's address","- 询问／说出某人的地址",1],["li","- Making confirmation about spelling","- 确认拼写",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 4","课堂活动 6A 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review of lesson 1-3","第 1–3 课复习",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review of lesson 1-3 IPA Review Review of lesson 1-3","第 1–3 课复习国际音标复习　第 1–3 课复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards","单词卡",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 8","EEC 3 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","swimming pool, life guard, swimsuit, water-wings, robe, pail, float , diving board",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you know I've moved?","A",1],["d","Really? Give me your address.","B",1],["d","12, Main Street","A",1],["d","How do you spell Main?","B",1],["d","M-A-I-N","A",1],["d","M-A-I-N?","B",1],["d","Right.","A",1],["d","OK.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class by the digital teaching. Have students see the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课。让学生看触控一体机并跟着念句子。",0],["li","(2) Quickly review last class's vocabularies. You pick out some students to write on the board or ask the class to pronounce then spell out the word together.","(2) 快速复习上一堂课的单词。挑几位学生到白板上写，或让全班一起念出并拼出单词。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["li","(4) After collecting the quiz go over all the vocabularies again.","(4) 收回小测验后，再把所有单词复习一遍。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (70 mins) Lesson 4","课堂活动（70 分钟）第 4 课",0],["h2","Who Likes Toys?","Who Likes Toys?（谁喜欢玩具？）",0],["h2","4.1-A",null,0],["li","(1) Review all the vocabularies from the previous lessons.","(1) 复习前几课所有的单词。",0],["li","(2) Review the three grammar key points of \"like/likes\", \"have/has\", \"want/wants\".","(2) 复习 \"like/likes\"、\"have/has\"、\"want/wants\" 三个语法重点。",0],["li","(3) Explain to the students that they can put all three key points together into one long sentence.","(3) 向学生解释可以把三个重点合成一个长句子。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into 3 or 4 teams and ask them to practice reading the sentences in this section.","(4) 把全班分成 3 或 4 队，让他们练习念这一部分的句子。",0],["li","(5) Play \"making sentences\" game","(5) 玩“造句”游戏",0],["li","- Create a chart similar to the one in this section but use the students name. Use magnets to put all the flashcards from previous lessons on the chart, but make sure the flashcards are turned over so they don't know which cards are where.","- 做一张和这一部分类似的表，但用学生的名字。用磁铁把前几课所有单词卡贴在表上，单词卡要翻面，让学生不知道哪张卡在哪里。",0],["li","(6) Each team picks out a name in the chart and the flashcards may be turned over in that row. Students must try to say the sentence using all three \"like/likes\", \"have/has\", and \"want/wants\"","(6) 每队从表中选一个名字，翻开那一列的单词卡。学生要用 \"like/likes\"、\"have/has\"、\"want/wants\" 三者说出句子。",0],["li","(7) Points may be given to the teams with correct sentences. Play until all the flashcards are turned over.","(7) 句子正确的队伍可以得分。玩到所有单词卡都翻开为止。",0],["h2","4.1-B",null,0],["li","(1) Practice the example questions together. Check to see that they understand.","(1) 一起练习例题，确定他们都懂。",0],["li","(2) With the same team from the game ask the class to have a race on which team can finish the exercise first without making any mistake. The fastest team may get some more points.","(2) 用游戏中的同样队伍，让全班比赛哪一队最先完成练习而且没有错误。最快的队伍可以多加分。",0],["li","(3) Go over all the questions together and ask different teams to read out the answers.","(3) 一起讲评所有题目，请不同队伍念出答案。",0],["h2","4.2",null,0],["li","(1) Follow the same steps as in 4.1-B.","(1) 照 4.1-B 的步骤进行。",0],["h2","4.3",null,0],["li","(1) Ask students to close their book and on the board write down all the words.","(1) 让学生合上书，在白板上写出所有单词。",0],["li","(2) Ask different teams to come up and try to fill in the IPA spelling of the words. One point is given to every IPA written correctly.","(2) 请不同队伍上来试着填写单词的国际音标。每写对一个得一分。",0],["h2","4.4",null,0],["li","(1) Teacher pronounces the sounds of each word and asks students to repeat the sounds.","(1) 老师念出每个字的音，让学生跟着念。",0],["li","(2) Ask different teams to read the chart. Points may be given to the teams without any mistake.","(2) 请不同队伍念表格。全对的队伍可以得分。",0],["h2","4.5",null,0],["li","(1) Teach the lyrics first and explain what the song is about.","(1) 先教歌词并解释歌曲内容。",0],["li","(2) Songs can be fun for the students. It's best to add some actions whiling singing the song or have a competition to see who can sing the best.","(2) 唱歌对学生来说很有趣。最好一边唱一边加上动作，或办个比赛看谁唱得最好。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.2","活动单 2",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["h3","Context Introduction","情境介绍",0],["p","Teacher introduce the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson eight. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below.","老师让学生听第八课“Let's See And Say”的独白来引入本课。老师可以念出或用 MP3 播放下面的独白给全班听。",0],["h3","Monolog Of Let's See And Say","Let's See And Say 独白",0],["p","How often do you go swimming? Do you like to go swimming with your friends? The two friends meet in the swimming pool and they are talking to each other. Let's listen to their conversation.","你多久去游泳一次？你喜欢和朋友一起去游泳吗？两个朋友在游泳池碰面，正在聊天。我们来听听他们的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have some kind of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there will be a short grammar quiz next lesson.","(3) 提醒学生下一课有语法小测验。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["li","1. Do you have a ______?","1. Do you have a ______?（你有……吗？）",0],["li","2. Do you like a ______?","2. Do you like a ______?（你喜欢……吗？）",0],["li","3. Do you want a ______?","3. Do you want a ______?（你想要……吗？）",0],["li","4. What do you have?","4. What do you have?（你有什么？）",0],["li","5. What do you want? PS. Teachers can use new words into the blanks.","5. What do you want?（你想要什么？）附注：老师可以把新单词填进空格。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1-3"]],[32,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6"]],[32,["Classroom Activities","Lesson 4"]],[78,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":95},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[24,25,26],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To ask and answer questions using a combination of like/likes, have/has, want/wants","- 综合使用 like/likes、have/has、want/wants 问答问题",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Making reminders","- 提醒别人",1],["li","- Asking for/ Saying one's address","- 询问／说出某人的地址",1],["li","- Making confirmation about spelling","- 确认拼写",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 5","课堂活动 6A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review of lesson 1-3","第 1–3 课复习",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Review of lesson 1-3 IPA Review Review of lesson 1-3","第 1–3 课复习国际音标复习　第 1–3 课复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Flashcards","单词卡",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 8","EEC 3 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","swimming pool, life guard, swimsuit, water-wings, robe, pail, float , diving board",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you know I've moved?","A",1],["d","Really? Give me your address.","B",1],["d","12. Main Street","A",1],["d","How do you spell Main?","B",1],["d","M-A-I-N","A",1],["d","M-A-I-N?","B",1],["d","Right.","A",1],["d","OK.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (15 mins)","热身 Warm Up（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the last class by the digital teaching. Have students see the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课。让学生看触控一体机并跟着念句子。",0],["li","(2) Quickly review last class's vocabularies. You pick out some students to write on the board or ask the class to pronounce then spell out the word together.","(2) 快速复习上一堂课的单词。挑几位学生到白板上写，或让全班一起念出并拼出单词。",0],["li","(3) Short grammar quiz.","(3) 语法小测验。",0],["li","(4) After collecting the quiz go over all the questions again.","(4) 收回小测验后，再把所有题目讲评一遍。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (60 mins) Lesson 5","课堂活动（60 分钟）第 5 课",0],["h2","Window Shopping","Window Shopping（逛街看橱窗）",0],["h2","5.1",null,0],["li","(1) Review all the vocabularies from the previous lessons.","(1) 复习前几课所有的单词。",0],["li","(2) Review the three grammar key points of \"like/likes\", \"have/has\", \"want/wants\".","(2) 复习 \"like/likes\"、\"have/has\"、\"want/wants\" 三个语法重点。",0],["li","(3) Practice the sentence structure with the students.","(3) 和学生练习句子结构。",0],["li","(4) Separate the class into 3 or 4 teams and ask them to write out other sentences by looking at the picture.","(4) 把全班分成 3 或 4 队，让他们看图写出其他句子。",0],["li","(5) More points will be given to the teams that can come up with the most sentences.","(5) 想出最多句子的队伍可以多加分。",0],["li","(6) Go over all the sentences students have come up with.","(6) 讲评学生想出的所有句子。",0],["h2","5.2",null,0],["li","(1) Practice the dialogues with the students.","(1) 和学生练习对话。",0],["li","(2) Put students in pairs and ask them to create a dialog similar to the ones in this section. Keep in mind that although they are in pairs they still represent their team.","(2) 让学生两两一组，编一段和这部分类似的对话。要记得虽然两人一组，他们仍代表自己的队伍。",0],["li","(3) Points may be given to the pairs with correct dialog.","(3) 对话正确的组可以得分。",0],["h2","5.3",null,0],["h3","Activity Sheet - 1","活动单 - 1",0],["p","Prepare some slips which each one has a student's name and what he/she likes, has, and wants. Prepare another slip similar to the one in the section. Students have go around asking questions until they fill out the entire chart. Ex:","准备一些纸条，每张写一位学生的名字和他／她喜欢、拥有、想要的东西。再准备一张和这部分类似的表。学生要四处问问题，直到填完整张表。例：",0],["d","Do you like walkman?","S1",0],["d","Yes, I do. I like walkman.","S2",0],["p","The first three students to finish may earn some more points for their team.","最先完成的三位学生可以为自己的队伍多加分。",0],["h2","5.4",null,0],["li","(1) Ask students to practice the rhymes with the teacher.","(1) 让学生跟老师练习韵文。",0],["li","(2) Give the students 5 minutes to write a rhyme using this section's rhyme as a reference.","(2) 给学生 5 分钟，参考这部分的韵文写一首自己的韵文。",0],["li","(3) Pick out some students to read out their rhyme. Collect the rhymes and you might find out how creative your students are.","(3) 挑几位学生念出他们的韵文。收回韵文，你可能会发现学生有多有创意。",0],["h2","5.5",null,0],["li","(1) Review the IPA from previous lessons.","(1) 复习前几课的国际音标。",0],["li","(2) Play IPA Bingo - prepare some extra blank papers so the students can may the IPA Bingo more than once.","(2) 玩国际音标宾果——多准备一些空白纸，让学生可以玩不只一次。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and repeat the following intonation contour","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour>\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teachers can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","Can you swim? How often do you go swimming? What can you see in the swimming pool? Please turn to page 34. Let's Check. Listen to the words and circle.","你会游泳吗？你多久去游泳一次？你在游泳池可以看到什么？请翻到第 34 页。Let's Check。听单词并圈出来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Fill in the missing letters","(3) 练习：填入缺少的字母",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10mins)","（10 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have some kind of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there are quiz # 1 and listening quiz next lesson.","(3) 提醒学生下一课有第 1 次小测验和听力测验。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4"]],[31,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities"]],[39,["Lesson 5"]],[86,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[27,28],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Making reminders","- 提醒别人",1],["li","- Asking for/ Saying one's address","- 询问／说出某人的地址",1],["li","- Making confirmation about spelling","- 确认拼写",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flashcards, tape recorder, S6 listening lab tape, sheets of the quiz Classroom Readers Review lesson 1 to lesson 3 Classroom Activities Review lesson 1 to lesson 5","单词卡、录音机、S6 听力测验录音带、小测验试卷　课堂读本 复习第 1 课到第 3 课　课堂活动 复习第 1 课到第 5 课",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 8","EEC 3 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","swimming pool, life guard, swimsuit, water-wings, robe, pail, float , diving board",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you know I've moved?","A",1],["d","Really? Give me your address.","B",1],["d","12. Main Street","A",1],["d","How do you spell Main?","B",1],["d","M-A-I-N","A",1],["d","M-A-I-N?","B",1],["d","Right.","A",1],["d","OK.","B",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use this time for any catching up on lessons or areas some students did not have time for in the first six classes. If students are caught up, Teacher can spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where students seem to be having difficulty. Teacher can do this by drills, games or any activity that Teacher feel would help Students. Choose those that Students are interested in the first five classes.","(1) 利用这段时间补上前六堂课中部分学生没来得及完成的课程或内容。如果学生都跟上了，老师可以用这段时间复习前几课，或学生似乎有困难的地方。老师可以用操练、游戏或任何觉得对学生有帮助的活动，挑选前五堂课中学生感兴趣的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review all the vocabularies.","(2) 复习所有单词。",0],["li","(3) Review all the sentence patterns.","(3) 复习所有句型。",0],["li","(4) Review all the IPA","(4) 复习所有国际音标。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Have Students put all books and unnecessary things away. Hand out the quiz and have students do it.","1. 请学生把所有书本和不需要的东西收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。",0],["li","(2) Make sure that Students know the meaning of each item.","2. 确认学生了解每一题的意思。",0],["li","(3) Walk around in the classroom and check the quiz for Students to avoid misunderstanding.","3. 在教室里走动检查考卷，避免学生误解题意。",0],["li","(4) Students can't talk or cheat during the quiz. If students can't get good grades, student has to make it up in the next class (Teacher can have their own grading standard.).","4. 小测验时学生不能说话或作弊。成绩不理想的学生，下次上课要补考。老师可以自定评分标准。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Check the tape and the recorder before students come back from the break, prepare for the listening quiz.","(1) 在学生下课休息回来前，先检查录音带和录音机，准备听力小测验。",0],["li","(2) Turn on the tape and have students fill in the appropriate blanks.","(2) 播放录音带，请学生在适当的空格中作答。",0],["li","(3) Since this is the first listening quiz, play the tape a few times. Students need to listen carefully.","(3) 因为这是第一次听力小测验，录音带可以多播几次。学生要仔细听。",0],["li","(4) Listening is a very important aspect of learning a new language.","(4) 听力是学习新语言非常重要的一环。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","It is a good time to remind the students to correct mistakes they have made from all the previous homework.","这是提醒学生订正之前所有作业错误的好时机。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there is test # 1.","(3) 提醒学生有第 1 次考试。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 3","电话教学教材 3",0],["li","1. Do you like ______?","1. Do you like ______?（你喜欢……吗？）",0],["li","2. Do you want ______?","2. Do you want ______?（你想要……吗？）",0],["li","3. Does your _____ have ________?","3. Does your _____ have ________?（你的……有……吗？）",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"________\"?","4. How do you spell \"________\"?（\"……\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","5. What do you have? PS. Teachers can use new words from L1~L5 into the blanks.","5. What do you have?（你有什么？）附注：老师可以把第 1～5 课的新单词填进空格。",0]],"g":[[20,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Readers/Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson 5"]],[43,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":95},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[29,30],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","First Test Classroom Readers 6: Review Lesson 1~3 Classroom Activities 6A: Review Lesson 1~5","第一次考试　课堂读本 6：复习第 1～3 课　课堂活动 6A：复习第 1～5 课",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flash cards for new words, flash cards and poster for IPA symbols","新单词单词卡、国际音标单词卡和海报",1],["h2","Review the words for First Test (15 mins)","复习第一次考试的单词（15 分钟）",0],["li","(1) Playing the \"Read my mouth\" game.","(1) 玩“读我的嘴型”游戏。",0],["li","- Divide the class into two teams, Team A and Team B.","- 把全班分成两队，A 队和 B 队。",0],["li","- You silently say a word. The students have to watch your mouth to guess what you are saying.","- 你不出声地说一个字，学生要看你的嘴型猜你在说什么。",0],["li","- The first student who says the word out loudly, wins a point for his team.","- 第一个大声说出那个字的学生为自己的队伍赢得一分。",0],["li","- The winner will be the speaker, let the others guess.","- 赢的人当说话者，让其他人猜。",0],["li","- Count the score and give reward cards to them.","- 计分并发奖励卡给他们。",0],["li","- T: Students, close your books. Look at my mouth carefully. Because you won't hear what I am saying. Are you ready?","- T：同学们，合上书。仔细看我的嘴巴，因为你们听不到我在说什么。准备好了吗？",0],["d","Yes. We are ready.","S",0],["h2","Review Classroom Readers (20 mins)","复习课堂读本（20 分钟）",0],["li","- Read Classroom Readers Lesson 1~3 with the students two times.","- 和学生一起念课堂读本第 1～3 课两次。",0],["li","- First time read the book. And Second time read it using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 第一次看书念，第二次用触控一体机念。",0],["li","- When they read with the touchscreen all-in-one, they can do some role play.","- 跟着触控一体机念时，可以做一些角色扮演。",0],["li","- Divide the class into several small teams.","- 把全班分成几个小队。",0],["li","- Ask the students about the question on Classroom Readers page 38.","- 问学生课堂读本第 38 页的问题。",0],["li","- Count score and give them award cards.","- 计分并发奖励卡给他们。",0],["h2","Review IPA Symbols (15 mins)","复习国际音标（15 分钟）",0],["li","- Review IPA symbols with flash cards or poster.","- 用单词卡或海报复习国际音标。",0],["li","- Give 2 bingo cards to the students.","- 发给学生 2 张宾果卡。",0],["li","- Write down the IPA symbols (Classroom Activities 6A page 39) on the board.","- 把国际音标（课堂活动 6A 第 39 页）写在白板上。",0],["li","- Let the students fill in the squares freely.","- 让学生自由填进方格。",0],["li","- T: OK! Now listen to me and circle the IPA symbols on your chart! The first on get five lines, he will get a award card. Are you ready?","- T：好！现在听我念，在你的表上圈出国际音标！第一个连成五条线的人可以得到一张奖励卡。准备好了吗？",0],["d","Yes, ready.","S",0],["h2","First Test (45 minutes)","第一次考试（45 分钟）",0],["li","- Firstly, assign a classroom leader to monitor students' behavior while you are out of the classroom.","- 首先，在你离开教室时指派一位班长维持学生秩序。",0],["li","- Let the students do their test.","- 让学生写考卷。",0],["li","- If someone finish, he can come out to do the oral test.","- 写完的人可以出来做口试。",0],["li","- Then he can read some English story books or draw quietly.","- 然后他可以安静地看英文故事书或画画。",0],["li","- Oral Test 1","- 口试 1",0],["li","1. Do you have a puppy?","1. Do you have a puppy?（你有小狗吗？）",0],["li","2. Do you like dogs?","2. Do you like dogs?（你喜欢狗吗？）",0],["li","3. Does your father have a motorcycle?","3. Does your father have a motorcycle?（你爸爸有摩托车吗？）",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"sundae\"?","4. How do you spell \"sundae\"?（\"sundae\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","5. What do you have in your lunch box today?","5. What do you have in your lunch box today?（你今天饭盒里有什么？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1- Homework Exercises","1- 家庭作业",0],["p","Record the voice when they read Classroom Readers Lesson 1~3 at home. Next time, when they come to the class. Give the tape to the teacher. Strongly encourage them and record it after their reading sound.","让学生在家念课堂读本第 1～3 课并录音，下次上课时把录音带交给老师。要大力鼓励他们，并在他们念完后录下评语。",0],["h2","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and ask the students to copy those items into their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到他们的进度报告上。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[4,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1~3"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":50},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[31,32],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["p","Review Class1-5 with Games and Activities","用游戏和活动复习第 1–5 堂课",0],["h2","Test Review (20 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Take this time to go over the test with students. Focus on areas where there seemed to be mistakes and difficulties.","利用这段时间和学生讲评考试，着重在似乎有错误和困难的地方。",0],["h2","Activity Sheet No.3 (20 mins)","活动单 3（20 分钟）",0],["p","Emphasize grammar using.","强调语法的使用。",0],["h2","Activity: \"do\" and \"don't\" (20mins)","活动：\"do\" 和 \"don't\"（20 分钟）",0],["p","Practice asking and writing skill. Part A-- Asking Let the students write down some vocabularies for part A. Finish the sentences. Remind the students the countable and uncountable nouns. Part B-Surveys Making example for the students.","练习提问和书写技巧。A 部分——提问：让学生为 A 部分写下一些单词，完成句子。提醒学生可数和不可数名词。B 部分——调查：为学生示范例子。",0],["d","Do you like apples?","T",0],["p","Everybody says \"Yes, I do.\"","每个人都说 \"Yes, I do.\"",0],["d","Yes, I do.","S",0],["d","Do you like guavas?","T",0],["p","Everybody says 'No, I don't.\"","每个人都说 \"No, I don't.\"",0],["d","No, I don't.","S",0],["d","Now, stand up. Visit your friends and write their names on the questions. Go!","T",0],["h2","Song: Mary has a little lamb. (15 minutes)","歌曲：Mary has a little lamb.（15 分钟）",0],["p","Change the vocabulary with lamb. \"Mary has a little puppy/fish/walkman/camera....\" Pick one student to be the lamb (puppy/fish...) while they are singing.","把 lamb 换成其他单词：\"Mary has a little puppy/fish/walkman/camera....\"　唱歌时挑一位学生当小羊（小狗／鱼……）。",0],["h3","\"What's missing?\" (20minutes)","“少了什么？”（20 分钟）",0],["p","Write some letters, words, numbers or draw some pictures on the white board. Divide the class into two teams. Have students put their heads down. Erase one thing off the board. Tell the students to look. Ask them \"What's missing?\". The first student to call out the correct answer gets a point.","在白板上写一些字母、单词、数字或画一些图。把全班分成两队。让学生趴下，擦掉白板上的一样东西，再叫学生看，问他们 \"What's missing?\"。第一个喊出正确答案的学生得一分。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 minutes)","加强（5 分钟）",0],["h3","Progress Report Book","学习进度手册",0],["p","Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports. Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","把学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进进度报告。逐一检查他们的进度报告，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依各队今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["li","1. Do you have the measles?","1. Do you have the measles?（你得了麻疹吗？）",0],["li","2. Do you like puppies?","2. Do you like puppies?（你喜欢小狗吗？）",0],["li","3. What do you have in your school bag?","3. What do you have in your school bag?（你书包里有什么？）",0],["li","4. Please spell \"camera\".","4. Please spell \"camera\".（请拼出 \"camera\"。）",0],["li","5. What do you like?","5. What do you like?（你喜欢什么？）",0]],"g":[[6,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":60},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[33,34,35,36],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","To state preferences","表达喜好",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking others to pass things at the table","- 用餐时请别人把东西递过来",1],["li","- Expressing regret","- 表达遗憾",1],["li","- Stating/ Asking reasons for apologizing","- 说明／询问道歉的理由",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 6 Lesson 4","课堂读本 6 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Mom, Harry Perkins, right now, early, late, both",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I like to ____. I want to ______.","I like to ____.（我喜欢……）I want to ______.（我想要……）",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 6","课堂活动 6A 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","play basketball, take tests, study computers, get up early, sleep late",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","(like/likes) to____;(want/wants) to ______ IPA symbols [l],[r],[w]","(like/likes) to____；(want/wants) to ______　国际音标 [l]、[r]、[w]",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","1. Copy Classroom Readers page 18~19. (New Stars for S6) Cut it down and color. It it's possible, make them big.","1. 复印课堂读本第 18～19 页（S6 新主角），剪下并着色。可能的话放大。",1],["li","2. Copy Classroom Readers page 12. Cut and color.","2. 复印课堂读本第 12 页，剪下并着色。",1],["li","3. Copy Classroom Activities page 42 (6.2). Make it big.","3. 复印课堂活动第 42 页（6.2），放大。",1],["li","4. Flash cards for vocabularies and IPA symbols","4. 单词和国际音标单词卡",1],["li","5. IPA chart copies (Classroom Activities 6A page 46)","5. 国际音标表格复印件（课堂活动 6A 第 46 页）",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 9","EEC 3 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bread, soda, pitcher, bottle, peanut butter, jam, ham, cheese",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Please pass the chocolate syrup.","A",1],["d","Here it is.","B",1],["d","Oops!","A",1],["d","What's up?","B",1],["d","I spilt some. I'm sorry.","A",1],["d","That's OK","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["h3","Review these sentences","复习这些句子",0],["d","How are you?","A",0],["d","I am fine/sick.","B",0],["p","have a (headache/toothache/fever/cold.....). Introduce the stars of Lesson 4 They are Harry Perkins, Mr. and Mrs. Perkins, Simon, Lucy, Alice, Tim, Miss Meany, and the cavemen. Show the pictures and lead students say hello to them.","have a (headache/toothache/fever/cold.....)。介绍第 4 课的主角：Harry Perkins、Perkins 先生和太太、Simon、Lucy、Alice、Tim、Miss Meany 和穴居人。展示图片，带学生跟他们打招呼。",0],["d","Students, How are you today?","T",0],["d","I am fine. Thank you. And you?","S",0],["d","Fine. (Show Harry Perkins<Teaching Aids 1>.)","T",0],["p","Students, this is Harry Perkins. He is Harry Potter's friend. Let us say hello to him.","同学们，这是 Harry Perkins。他是 Harry Potter 的朋友。我们来跟他打招呼。",0],["d","Hello! Harry!","S",0],["p","How are you?",null,0],["d","(Pretend the voice) I am fine. Thanks!","T",0],["p","(Give students the other roles and feelings cards<Teaching Aids 2>.)","（发给学生其他角色和心情卡《教具 2》。）",0],["d","Hello! I am Harry. What is your name?","T",0],["d","I am Simon.","Student 1",0],["d","Hi! Simon. How are you?","T",0],["d","I am sick. I have a headache. How are you?","Student 1",0],["d","I am fine. Thanks. Take care. God bless you.","T",0],["d","Thank you.","Student 1",0],["p","Take turns.","轮流进行。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 4 (30 mins)","课堂读本第 4 课（30 分钟）",0],["h2","Get up, Harry!","Get up, Harry!（起床了，Harry！）",0],["p","Books closed. They have been introduced to the characters. Teach them to use \"to\" as the infinitive. Give some examples how to use it. For instance, \"I like to ____. I want to ______.\" Activity: \" Do you like to dance?\"","合上书。学生已经认识角色了。教他们用 \"to\" 作为不定式，举几个例子说明用法，例如 \"I like to ____. I want to ______.\"　活动：\"Do you like to dance?\"",0],["h3","Yes. I do. No. I don't.","Yes. I do. No. I don't.（是，我喜欢。不，我不喜欢。）",0],["h3","Do you like to .......?","Do you like to .......?（你喜欢……吗？）",0],["h3","I like to ...... I like to ...","I like to ...... I like to ...（我喜欢……）",0],["p","dance Ex: Mary Ex: Andy study computers take tests play basketball get up early sleep late",null,0],["li","1. Explain \"both\" to students. Give them some examples to understand and to make some sentences.","1. 向学生解释 \"both\"。举一些例子帮助他们理解并造句。",0],["li","● both + plural","● both + 复数名词",0],["li","● both +(of) the/those/these/my/Tom's ...",null,0],["li","● both + of them (object) 2.","● both + of them（宾格）2.",0],["h3","Questions May Bob Both of them are......","问题　May　Bob　Both of them are......（他们两个都……）",0],["p","1.Are you Chinese? Yes Yes 2.How old are you? 10 10 3.Do you have a bike? Yes Yes 4.Where do you live? Beijing Beijing 5.Can you play the piano? Yes Yes",null,0],["li","3. Teach students how to spell the vocabularies for phonics. If you meet the sounds that they have been taught with IPA symbols, write it under the letter.","3. 教学生用自然拼读拼单词。遇到已经用国际音标教过的音，就写在字母下面。",0],["li","4. Open the book. Go through the story. Read and explain it.","4. 打开书，看一遍故事，念出来并解释。",0],["li","5. Read it together with students. Using digital teaching, turn off the voice, and read it again. You can assign someone to be Harry or Harry's mother to play the story.","5. 和学生一起念。用数字教学把声音关掉再念一次。可以指定学生扮演 Harry 或 Harry 的妈妈来演出故事。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 6 (30 mins)","课堂活动 6A 第 6 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","Harry Like To Play Basketball","Harry Like To Play Basketball（Harry 喜欢打篮球）",0],["p","1.Using Classroom Activities 6.2 cards<Teaching Aid 3> to teach how to make sentences with these words. 2.Using digital teaching to go through 6.2 Part A. 3.Divide the class into some teams. Let them discuss 6.2 Part B. After 5 minutes, let them read their answers out. 4.Review the grammar of \"both\". Using digital teaching to go through 6.3.","1. 用课堂活动 6.2 的卡片《教具 3》教学生用这些字造句。2. 用数字教学带过 6.2 A 部分。3. 把全班分成几队，让他们讨论 6.2 B 部分，5 分钟后请他们念出答案。4. 复习 \"both\" 的语法，用数字教学带过 6.3。",0],["h2","6.4 IPA Symbols [ l ], [ r ], [ w ] (10 mins)","6.4 国际音标 [ l ]、[ r ]、[ w ]（10 分钟）",0],["p","1.Using flash card to show and read the symbols. 2.Practice the symbols for 6.4 Part A 3.Close the book. Give the copy sheet <Teaching Aids 5> to students. 4.Play Bingo game. 5.Using digital teaching, review the chart again.","1. 用单词卡展示并念出音标。2. 练习 6.4 A 部分的音标。3. 合上书，发给学生复印单《教具 5》。4. 玩宾果游戏。5. 用数字教学再复习一次表格。",0],["li","1. Go through 6.4 Part B on the board.","1. 在白板上带过 6.4 B 部分。",0],["li","2. Let students do the test for 6.4 Part C. How to do 6.4 part C? Ex: Teacher reads each word and have students write the IPA phonetic symbols in the book.","2. 让学生做 6.4 C 部分的测验。6.4 C 部分怎么做？例：老师念出每个字，让学生在书上写出国际音标。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 5 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","The little girl is eating breakfast with his father but she is not careful. Let's listen to what will happen to her.","小女孩正和爸爸吃早餐，但她不小心。我们来听听她会发生什么事。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement(5 mins)","加强（5 分钟）",0],["h3","1. Review today's by using touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2. Progress Report Book","2. 进度报告本",0],["p","Write the learning items on the board and have students to copy in Their progress reports. Check their progress reports individually and give students some comments or encouragement. Give students reward cards according to their performances today.","把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到进度报告上。逐一检查他们的进度报告，给学生一些评语或鼓励。依学生今天的表现发奖励卡。",0]],"g":[[53,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Readers","Lesson 4"]],[53,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","6.2","Part A","Classroom","Activities","6.3","Classroom","Activities","6.4","Part A"]],[93,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[37,38,39,40,41],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To know chore-related vocabulary","- 认识和家事有关的单词",1],["li","- To talk about activities","- 谈论活动",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking others to pass things at the table","- 用餐时请别人把东西递过来",1],["li","- Expressing regret","- 表达遗憾",1],["li","- Stating/ Asking reasons for apologizing","- 说明／询问道歉的理由",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 6 Lesson 5","课堂读本 6 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","kitchen, honey, birthday, soon, party, terrific, tell",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I have to ____. He has to ______.","I have to ____.（我必须……）He has to ______.（他必须……）",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 7","课堂活动 6A 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","sweep the floor, wash the car, clean my room, help my mother, put away the toys",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","(have/has) to____ IPA symbols [aʊ]","(have/has) to____　国际音标 [aʊ]",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","1. Copy Classroom Readers page 23. Color it. If possible, make them big.","1. 复印课堂读本第 23 页并着色。可能的话放大。",1],["li","2. Copy Classroom Activities page 48 (7.2). Make it big.","2. 复印课堂活动第 48 页（7.2），放大。",1],["li","3. Flash cards for the vocabulary and IPA symbols","3. 单词和国际音标单词卡",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 9","EEC 3 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bread, soda, pitcher, bottle, peanut butter, jam, ham, cheese",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Please pass the chocolate syrup.","A",1],["d","Here it is.","B",1],["d","Oops!","A",1],["d","What's up?","B",1],["d","I spilt some. I'm sorry.","A",1],["d","That's OK.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5 mins)","热身 Warm Up（5 mins）",0],["li","1. Have the students read Classroom Readers, Lesson 4 once.","1. 让学生念一次课堂读本第 4 课。",0],["li","2. Ask the students the questions from Classroom Readers page 39.","2. 问学生课堂读本第 39 页的问题。",0],["li","3. Spelling practice-","3. 拼写练习——",0],["d","Who can spell \"both\"? OK! Andy!","T",0],["d","\"b-o-t-h\"","Andy",0],["d","Good. Who can make a sentence with \"both\"? OK! Mary.","T",0],["d","\"You and your father are both late!","Mary",0],["d","Good.","T",0],["p","Do the practice words and sentences.","做练习单词和句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 5 (40 mins)","课堂读本第 5 课（40 分钟）",0],["h3","Party Plans","Party Plans（派对计划）",0],["li","4. Books closed. Teach them to use \"to\" as the infinitive. Give examples. Explain \" want\" and \"have to.\" Activity: \"I don't want to do it, but I have to do it.\" (Activity Sheet A) Activity Sheet A-I don't want to, but I have to.","4. 合上书。教学生用 \"to\" 作为不定式，举例说明。解释 \"want\" 和 \"have to\"。活动：\"I don't want to do it, but I have to do it.\"（活动单 A）活动单 A——我不想，但我必须。",0],["h3","No. I don't.","No. I don't.（不，我不想。）",0],["h3","Yes. I do.","Yes. I do.（是，我想。）",0],["h3","Do you want to .......? I want to ...","Do you want to .......?（你想要……吗？）I want to ...（我想要……）",0],["h3","I want to ......","I want to ......（我想要……）",0],["h3","But I have to...","But I have to...（但我必须……）",0],["h2","Ex: Mary Ex: Andy","例：Mary　例：Andy",0],["p","sweep the floor(picture) wash the car (picture) help my mother(picture) put away the toys (picture) clean my room(picture) study Chinese(picture) sleep early(picture)","sweep the floor（图）wash the car（图）help my mother（图）put away the toys（图）clean my room（图）study Chinese（图）sleep early（图）",0],["h3","Review these words","复习这些字",0],["p","I want to have to you want to have to he wants to has to she wants to has to It wants to has to",null,0],["li","5. Teach the students how to spell the vocabulary for phonics. If you meet the sounds that they have been taught with IPA symbols, write them under the letter.","5. 教学生用自然拼读拼单词。遇到已经用国际音标教过的音，就写在字母下面。",0],["li","6. Open the book. Go through the story. Read and explain it.","6. 打开书，看一遍故事，念出来并解释。",0],["li","7. Teach prepositions. (Activity Sheet B-Where are you?)","7. 教介词。（活动单 B——Where are you?）",0],["li","8. Draw a clock and ask the students what they should say to their parents.","8. 画一个时钟，问学生应该对父母说什么。",0],["d","It's 7 o'clock in the morning.","T",0],["p","Let's say \"Good morning.\"","我们来说 \"Good morning.\"",0],["d","\"Good morning.\"","S",0],["p","Change the time and practice \"Good afternoon.\" \" Good evening.\" and \"Good night.\" Explain prepositions. \" at + short time\" ex. At lunch time. \" on + longer time\" ex. On Sunday. Differentiate these sentences. \"I go to church on Sunday.\" \"I go to church on Sundays.\"","改变时间，练习 \"Good afternoon.\"、\"Good evening.\" 和 \"Good night.\"。解释介词：\"at + 短时间\"，例如 At lunch time；\"on + 较长的时间\"，例如 On Sunday。区分这两句：\"I go to church on Sunday.\" 和 \"I go to church on Sundays.\"",0],["li","9. Explain and make examples with \"go to school\" and \"go to the school.\"","9. 解释 \"go to school\" 和 \"go to the school\" 并举例。",0],["li","10. Explain and make examples with \"Here is your breakfast.\" and \"Here you are.\"","10. 解释 \"Here is your breakfast.\" 和 \"Here you are.\" 并举例。",0],["li","11. (Activity Sheet C-Who is liar?) Let students differentiate these sentences and explain why. Activity Sheet C-Who is liar? (Put some pictures in the chart.)","11. （活动单 C——谁在说谎？）让学生区分这些句子并说明原因。活动单 C——谁在说谎？（在表中放一些图片。）",0],["h3","True/False Sentences","对／错句子",0],["p","\" I love you,\" says Mr. A. \" I love you,\" say Mr. B. \" I love you,\" Mr. C say. \" I love you,\" Mr. D says. \" I love you,\" say he. \" I love you,\" says he. \" I love you,\" she say. \" I love you,\" she says. Read it together with students. Using digital teaching, turn off the voice, and read it again. You can assign someone to be Harry or Harry's parents to play the story.","\" I love you,\" says Mr. A. \" I love you,\" say Mr. B. \" I love you,\" Mr. C say. \" I love you,\" Mr. D says. \" I love you,\" say he. \" I love you,\" says he. \" I love you,\" she say. \" I love you,\" she says.　和学生一起念。用数字教学把声音关掉再念一次。可以指定学生扮演 Harry 或 Harry 的父母来演出故事。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 7 (30 mins)","课堂活动 6A 第 7 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","We Can't Go Out Today","We Can't Go Out Today（我们今天不能出去）",0],["li","1. Using Classroom Activities","1. 用课堂活动",0],["li","2. cards<Teaching Aid 2>to teach how to make sentences with these words.","2. 卡片《教具 2》教学生用这些字造句。",0],["li","3. Using digital teaching to go through 7.2 Part A. Picture 1~5. Make a list for Mrs. Perkins. Draw a big schedule chart on a board. Lead students try to arrange Mrs. Perkins' schedule again. Do the same procedures with Mr. Perkins and Harry Perkins.","3. 用数字教学带过 7.2 A 部分的图 1～5，为 Perkins 太太列一张清单。在白板上画一张大行程表，带学生再试着安排 Perkins 太太的行程。对 Perkins 先生和 Harry Perkins 也照同样步骤做。",0],["li","4. Review the grammar of \" have/has/want/wants.\" Open the book page 51. Let students answer the questions orally.","4. 复习 \"have/has/want/wants\" 的语法。打开书第 51 页，让学生口头回答问题。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols [aʊ] (5 mins)","国际音标 [aʊ]（5 分钟）",0],["h3","U",null,0],["li","1. Using flash cards to show and read the symbols from Lesson 1~6.","1. 用单词卡展示并念出第 1～6 课的音标。",0],["li","2. Practice the symbols for 7.4 Part A","2. 练习 7.4 A 部分的音标。",0],["li","3. Close the book. Using digital teaching, practicing 7.3A and 7.3B.","3. 合上书，用数字教学练习 7.3A 和 7.3B。",0],["li","4. Open the book. Let students do the test for 7.3 Part C.","4. 打开书，让学生做 7.3 C 部分的测验。",0],["h2","EEC (15mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and repeat the following intonation contour.","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teacher can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","You can see there are different kinds of food on the table. Which ones do you like, which ones don't you like? Please turn to page 38. Let's Check. Listen and circle.","你可以看到桌上有各种食物。你喜欢哪些？不喜欢哪些？请翻到第 38 页。Let's Check。听一听，圈出来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to match the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Connect the sentences to the food","(3) 练习：把句子和食物连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["li","1. Review today's by using touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["li","2. Progress Report Book Write the learning items on the board and have students to copy in their progress reports. Check their progress reports individually and give students some comments or encouragement. Give students reward cards according to their performances today.","2. 进度报告本　把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到进度报告上。逐一检查他们的进度报告，给学生一些评语或鼓励。依学生今天的表现发奖励卡。",0],["h2","Today's Homework:","今天的作业：",0],["li","1. Homework Exercises A: Lesson 7","1. 家庭作业 A：第 7 课",0],["li","2. Write down the answers on Classroom Activities A page 51.","2. 在课堂活动 A 第 51 页写下答案。",0],["li","3. Recite Classroom Reader Lesson 5.","3. 背诵课堂读本第 5 课。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5"]],[41,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Activities","Lesson 5"]],[49,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 7","Lesson 6","Classroom","Activities","7.2","Part A","Classroom","Activities","7.2","Part B","Classroom","Activities","7.3","Part A","Park B"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[42,43,44],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["li","- To identify the six months of the years","- 认识一年中的六个月份",1],["li","- To know the correct order of the months and days each month has","- 知道月份的正确顺序和每个月有几天",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking others to pass things at the table","- 用餐时请别人把东西递过来",1],["li","- Expressing regret","- 表达遗憾",1],["li","- Stating/ Asking reasons for apologizing","- 说明／询问道歉的理由",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 6 Lesson 6","课堂读本 6 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","lesson, answer, ringing, Alice, Simon, January",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Months of the year","一年的月份",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson 8","课堂活动 6B 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","January, February, March, April, May, June",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Months of the year What month comes after February? IPA symbols [ʃ], [ʒ]","一年的月份　What month comes after February?（二月之后是几月？）国际音标",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Calendar (January~ June)","月历（一月～六月）",1],["d","Write down the months on cards .....(Jordan's has flashcards)","Months Cards",1],["p","Copy Classroom Activities 6B Page 4 Copy Classroom Activities 6B Page 6 and Page 7","复印课堂活动 6B 第 4 页　复印课堂活动 6B 第 6 页和第 7 页",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 9","EEC 3 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","bread, soda, pitcher, bottle, peanut butter, jam, ham, cheese",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Please pass the chocolate syrup.","A",1],["d","Here it is.","B",1],["d","Oops!","A",1],["d","What's up?","B",1],["d","I spilt some. I'm sorry.","A",1],["d","That's OK.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5mins)","热身（5 分钟）",0],["li","1. Lead students to read Classroom Readers Lesson 5.","1. 带学生念课堂读本第 5 课。",0],["li","2. Ask students the questions on Classroom Readers page 39.","2. 问学生课堂读本第 39 页的问题。",0],["li","3. Spelling practice for Classroom Readers Lesson 5.","3. 课堂读本第 5 课的拼写练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 6 (40 mins)","课堂读本第 6 课（40 分钟）",0],["h3","A Spelling Lesson","A Spelling Lesson（一堂拼写课）",0],["li","1. Books closed.","1. 合上书。",0],["li","2. Review the using of numbers and ordinal numbers.","2. 复习数字和序数的用法。",0],["h2","Insert Picture A","插入图片 A",0],["li","3. Show students the calendar (Teaching Aid 1). Explain what a calendar is to the class and what the calendar is used for.","3. 给学生看月历（教具 1），向全班解释什么是月历以及月历的用途。",0],["li","4. Using flash cards(one word) to lead students reading the months very well.","4. 用单词卡（一个字）带学生把月份念熟。",0],["h3","CALENDAR",null,0],["li","5. Review the use of prepositions when referring to dates and time phrases. \"In\" is the preposition used for months.","5. 复习说日期和时间短语时介词的用法。月份用的介词是 \"In\"。",0],["li","6. Divide the class into several teams. There are six people in a team. Play a Game-Put Them In Order Give students the Months Cards (Teaching Aids 2). Draw some charts on the board. Every team has a chart. Let students line up in order in front of the board and write the month in his/her hand on the board. The first team finishes it, and they can read them loudly, then they win the game.","6. 把全班分成几队，每队六人。玩游戏——排排看：发给学生月份卡（教具 2）。在白板上画几张表，每队一张。让学生在白板前依序排好，把手上的月份写在白板上。最先完成并大声念出来的队伍获胜。",0],["li","7. Open the book. Read and explain the grammar using.","7. 打开书，念出来并解释语法用法。",0],["li","8. Using digital teaching, turn off the voice, and read it again. You can assign someone to be the roles in the text to play the story.","8. 用数字教学把声音关掉再念一次。可以指定学生扮演课文中的角色来演出故事。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 8 (30 mins)","课堂活动 6A 第 8 课（30 分钟）",0],["p","Learning About Months","Learning About Months（认识月份）",0],["li","1. Using the flash cards to practice the new vocabularies and making sentences.","1. 用单词卡练习新单词并造句。",0],["li","2. Open book on Page 4. Read the new vocabularies in order and in backwards.","2. 打开书第 4 页，按顺序和倒过来念新单词。",0],["li","3. Closed the book. Using Classroom Activities 8.2 <Teaching Aid 3> to ask students the questions on Classroom Activities 6B Page 5. Using digital teaching to go through 8.2 Part C. Let students answer the questions orally.","3. 合上书，用课堂活动 8.2《教具 3》问学生课堂活动 6B 第 5 页的问题。用数字教学带过 8.2 C 部分，让学生口头回答问题。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols (5mins)","国际音标（5 分钟）",0],["li","1. Using flash cards to show and read the symbols from Lesson 1~7.","1. 用单词卡展示并念出第 1～7 课的音标。",0],["li","2. Practice the symbols for 8.3.","2. 练习 8.3 的音标。",0],["li","3. Close the book. Using digital teaching, practicing 8.3A and 8.3B.","3. 合上书，用数字教学练习 8.3A 和 8.3B。",0],["li","4. Open the book. Let students do the test for 8.3 Part C.","4. 打开书，让学生做 8.3 C 部分的测验。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5mins)","加强（5 分钟）",0],["li","1. Review today's lesson by using touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["li","2. Progress Report Book Write the learning items on the board and have students to copy in their progress reports. Check their progress reports individually and give students some comments or encouragement. Give students reward cards according to their performances today.","2. 进度报告本　把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到进度报告上。逐一检查他们的进度报告，给学生一些评语或鼓励。依学生今天的表现发奖励卡。",0],["h2","Today's Homework:","今天的作业：",0],["li","1. Homework Exercises A: Lesson 8","1. 家庭作业 A：第 8 课",0],["li","2. Write down the answers on Classroom Activities B page 6~7.","2. 在课堂活动 B 第 6～7 页写下答案。",0],["li","3. Recite Classroom Reader Lesson 6.","3. 背诵课堂读本第 6 课。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6"]],[39,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Lesson 8","Classroom","Activities","8.2","Part C","Classroom","Activities","8.3","Part A","Park B"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[45,46,47],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["li","- To identify the last six months of the year","- 认识一年中的后六个月份",1],["li","- To know the correct order of the months and how many days each month has","- 知道月份的正确顺序和每个月有几天",1],["li","- To identify some holidays and express when they occur","- 认识一些节日并说出它们在什么时候",1],["h3","Classroom Readers 6 Lesson 7","课堂读本 6 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","plum, honey, September, kid, let's",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Months of the year","一年的月份",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson 9","课堂活动 6B 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Judy, August, September, October, November, December",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Months of the year IPA symbols [ɔɪ]","一年的月份国际音标 [ɔɪ]",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","1. New vocabulary flash cards","1. 新单词单词卡",1],["li","2. dice","2. 骰子",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 10","EEC 3 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","lion, elephant, zebra, tiger, monkey, crocodile, giraffe, turtle",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What's this?","A",1],["d","It is a parrot.","B",1],["d","Is it dangerous?","A",1],["d","No, it's kind.","B",1],["d","It's colorful!","A",1],["d","And it can talk, too.","B",1],["d","Really?","A",1],["d","Yeah. It repeats after you.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5 mins)","热身 Warm Up（5 mins）",0],["li","1. Lead students read Classroom Readers Lesson 6.","1. 带学生念课堂读本第 6 课。",0],["li","2. Ask students the questions on Classroom Readers page 39.","2. 问学生课堂读本第 39 页的问题。",0],["li","3. Spelling practice for Classroom Readers Lesson 6.","3. 课堂读本第 6 课的拼写练习。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 7 (35 mins)","课堂读本第 7 课（35 分钟）",0],["li","1. Books closed.","1. 合上书。",0],["li","2. Using digital teaching to review fast food. Ask students some questions.","2. 用数字教学复习快餐，问学生一些问题。",0],["d","Do you like a cheeseburger, Gina?","T",0],["p","S-Gina: \"Yes, I do.\" Or \"No, I don't.\"","S-Gina：\"Yes, I do.\" 或 \"No, I don't.\"",0],["li","3. Review the days in a week.","3. 复习一周的七天。",0],["li","4. Teach students about \"when\" and how to use it in time phrases.","4. 教学生 \"when\" 以及如何在时间短语中使用。",0],["li","5. Open the book. Read and explain the grammar using.","5. 打开书，念出来并解释语法用法。",0],["li","6. Using digital teaching, read it with the touchscreen all-in-one.","6. 用数字教学跟着触控一体机念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities 6A Lesson 9 (35 mins)","课堂活动 6A 第 9 课（35 分钟）",0],["h3","Months of the year","一年的月份",0],["li","1. Using the flash cards to practice the new vocabularies and making sentences.","1. 用单词卡练习新单词并造句。",0],["li","2. Teach the months and holidays that are in those months. Notice that some of the holidays are using the apostrophe for possession.","2. 教月份以及各月份里的节日。注意有些节日名称用撇号（'）表示所有格。",0],["li","3. Using digital teaching to teach 9.2 Part A. Practice asking and answering questions orally. Pair them up and have them give their responses out loud.","3. 用数字教学教 9.2 A 部分。口头练习问答，让学生两两一组大声说出回答。",0],["li","4. Open the book on page 13. Match the pictures and complete the sentences.","4. 打开书第 13 页，把图片配对并完成句子。",0],["h3","5. Activity Sheet No.3","5. 活动单 3",0],["h2","IPA Symbols [ɔɪ] (5 mins)","国际音标 [ɔɪ]（5 分钟）",0],["li","1. Using flash cards to show and read the symbols from Lesson 1~8.","1. 用单词卡展示并念出第 1～8 课的音标。",0],["li","2. Practice the symbols for 9.3.","2. 练习 9.3 的音标。",0],["li","3. Close the book. Using digital teaching, practicing 9.3A and 9.3B.","3. 合上书，用数字教学练习 9.3A 和 9.3B。",0],["li","4. Open the book. Let students do the test for 9.3 Part C.","4. 打开书，让学生做 9.3 C 部分的测验。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","Do you like to go to the zoo? What's your favorite animal? Now let's go to the zoo together.","你喜欢去动物园吗？你最喜欢什么动物？现在我们一起去动物园吧。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["li","1. Review today's by using touchscreen all-in-one.","1. 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["li","2. Progress Report Book Write the learning items on the board and have students to copy in their progress reports. Check their progress reports individually and give students some comments or encouragement. Give students reward cards according to their performances today.","2. 进度报告本　把学习项目写在白板上，让学生抄到进度报告上。逐一检查他们的进度报告，给学生一些评语或鼓励。依学生今天的表现发奖励卡。",0],["h2","Today's Homework: ●","今天的作业：●",0],["li","1. Homework Exercises A: Lesson 9","1. 家庭作业 A：第 9 课",0],["li","2. Write down the answers on Classroom Activities B page 12.","2. 在课堂活动 B 第 12 页写下答案。",0],["li","3. Recite Classroom Reader Lesson 7.","3. 背诵课堂读本第 7 课。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Reader 6","Lesson 7"]],[42,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Lesson 9","Classroom","Activities","9.2","Part A"]],[75,["Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[48,49,50,51],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- Review seasons of the year","- 复习一年的四季",1],["li","- Review the months of the year","- 复习一年的月份",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Asking about things around","- 询问周遭的事物",1],["li","- Asking/ Saying one's features","- 询问／说出某人的特征",1],["li","- Showing interest about something","- 对某事表示兴趣",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8","Classroom Readers 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Video, welcome, ice skates, winter, summer, push, button.",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","To review seasons Classroom Activities Lesson 10","复习四季　课堂活动第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Spring, summer, fall, winter.",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","To identify the seasons of the year, to name the months of the year. IPA symbols [dʒ] [tʃ]","认识一年的四季，说出一年的月份。国际音标 [dʒ] [tʃ]",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["li","1. Vocabulary flash cards, plastic ball, 12 large pieces of paper with the months of the year.","1. 单词单词卡、塑料球、12 张写有月份的大纸。",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 10","EEC 3 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","lion, elephant, zebra, tiger, monkey, crocodile, giraffe, turtle",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","What's this?","A",1],["d","It is a parrot.","B",1],["d","Is it dangerous?","A",1],["d","No, it's kind.","B",1],["d","It's colorful!","A",1],["d","And it can talk, too.","B",1],["d","Really?","A",1],["d","Yeah. It repeats after you.","B",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Spelling attendance. Call out a student's name and have them spell a word. This may seem to be somewhat redundant, but it keeps the students on their toes.","1. 拼写点名。叫一位学生的名字，让他拼一个字。这看起来有点多余，但能让学生保持警觉。",0],["li","2. Introduce the new vocabulary by paging to the website location given in the column on the right side.","2. 翻到右栏所列的网站位置来介绍新单词。",0],["li","3. Say and pronounce the words after the voice heard on the loudspeaker. Let the students say the words with you. The do the following game, a mime. First give some actions for every vocabulary word and let the students do the actions. When they know one action for each word; let one student stand outside the classroom. When he/she comes in, everyone inside the class can mime one of the seasons together and the student has to guess which season is it.","3. 跟着喇叭的声音说出并念出单词，让学生跟你一起说。接着玩下面的比手画脚游戏：先为每个单词设计一些动作，让学生做动作。等他们每个字都知道一个动作后，请一位学生站到教室外。他／她进来时，教室里所有人一起比出某个季节，那位学生要猜是哪个季节。",0],["h2","Classroom readers (20 mins)","课堂读本（20 分钟）",0],["li","1. Open the reader at the right place; use the digital medium. Turn off the speakers and Let the students look at the pictures and the words on the screen. Let them watch \"Learn and Play\" and then see if they can tell you anything about the story. For instance, can they make out the event is a birthday, and can they tell whose birthday it is? See who can tell you the most about what they have seen and give a reward to the student.","1. 用数字教材打开读本到正确位置。关掉喇叭，让学生看屏幕上的图和字。让他们看 \"Learn and Play\"，再看看他们能不能说出故事的内容。例如，他们能不能看出这是生日，能不能说出是谁的生日？看谁能说出最多看到的内容，给那位学生奖励。",0],["li","2. Then turn on the speakers and let them listen to the sound and look at the pictures.","2. 然后打开喇叭，让他们一边听声音一边看图。",0],["li","3. Open the books and read the story together and individually.","3. 打开书，全班一起念，也个别念故事。",0],["li","4. Be sure to use the questions at the back of the book to quiz the students.","4. 一定要用书后的问题考学生。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: (40 mins)","课堂活动（40 分钟）",0],["p","Open the website at the given exercise. Click on Part 10.2 A let the students listen to the voice. Do not type in the answers, but let the students listen to them. Then ask a volunteer in the class to repeat and read again what was just read out aloud to them. Quickly type in the answers when the students read it. Follow the same procedure for the whole exercise. Do one paragraph at a time though and give many students a turn.","打开网站到指定的练习。点 Part 10.2 A 让学生听声音。先不要输入答案，让学生听。然后请一位自愿的学生重复念刚才听到的内容，学生念的时候迅速输入答案。整个练习都照同样程序进行，但一次做一段，让很多学生都有机会。",0],["li","1. Teach the students the following rhyme: 'Winter, Spring, Summer , Fall, I like ___________ best of all\" Do a quick drill and let every student say it quickly. See who can speak fast and with good pronunciation. Give a reward.","1. 教学生下面这首韵文：\"Winter, Spring, Summer, Fall, I like ___________ best of all\"。快速操练，让每位学生快速说一遍。看谁说得快、发音又好，给予奖励。",0],["li","2. Draw 12 large circles, one for each month of the year. Choose a leader of the game and the leader must call out one month of the year. Everyone then runs to that circle but anyone who is touched by the ball thrown by the leader must sit down. The aim is to reach the circle every time without getting hit by the ball. See who can stay the longest in the game.","2. 画 12 个大圆圈，每个代表一个月份。选一位游戏领袖，由他喊出一个月份，大家跑向那个圆圈，但被领袖丢的球碰到的人必须坐下。目标是每次都跑到圆圈而不被球打到。看谁能留到最后。",0],["h3","3. Activity Sheet No.5","3. 活动单 5",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (10 minutes) [dʒ] [tʃ]","国际音标／自然拼读（10 分钟）[dʒ] [tʃ]",0],["p","了",null,0],["li","1. Introduce the two sounds to the class. Practice the sounds with the class and construct a few words with the two sounds as example.","1. 向全班介绍这两个音，和全班练习发音，并用这两个音组成几个字作为例子。",0],["li","2. Then Divide the c1ass in half. Give everyone a piece of paper and tell everyone to write one of the sounds on each side. Say a word with one of the sounds. They have to hold up the side of the card that they think has the right sound for the word.","2. 把全班分成两半。每人发一张纸，让大家在正反两面各写一个音。说一个含有其中一个音的字，学生要举起他们认为是正确音的那一面。",0],["li","3. The side of the room with most correct answers wins a point. Page to the digital site and find the exercise indicated in the column on the right. Show the pictures on the screen and let the students click on the IPA sounds of the words in the pictures.","3. 答对最多的一边得一分。翻到数字网站，找右栏所列的练习。在屏幕上显示图片，让学生点击图中单词的国际音标。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and repeat the following intonation contour","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teacher can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(2) Listen and connect the animals to the zoo","(2) 听一听，把动物和动物园连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below.","播放 Let's Check 部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下。",0],["h3","Monolog Of Let's Check","Let's Check 独白",0],["p","There are lots of animals in the zoo. What are the animals that you like? What are the animals that scare you? Can you find them in the picture? Please turn to page 42. Let's Check. Listen and connect the animals to the zoo.","动物园里有很多动物。你喜欢哪些动物？哪些动物让你害怕？你能在图中找到它们吗？请翻到第 42 页。Let's Check。听一听，把动物和动物园连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to match the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Check the features of each animal","(3) 练习：勾出每种动物的特征",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["p","Review today's work using the books. Students may make notes in their books with pencils.","用课本复习今天的内容。学生可以用铅笔在书上做笔记。",0],["h2","2-Homework","2-作业",0],["p","Preview the homework on the website.","在网站上预习作业。",0],["h2","3-Progress report","3-进度报告",0],["p","Write the learning items on the board and let the students write it in their progress report books. Give a reminder for test one.","把学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进进度报告本。提醒第一次考试。",0]],"g":[[35,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","进阶学习▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","readers","lesson 8"]],[40,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 10","Part 10.1","&","Part 10.2A,B","Playing a game","Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 10","Part 10.3 AB","Part 10.3 C"]],[79,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":85},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[52,53],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["p","Goals: CR/CA Review goals from Classroom Readers Lesson 4-8 Review goals from Classroom Activities Lesson 6 - 10 Review grammar","目标：CR/CA　复习课堂读本第 4–8 课的目标　复习课堂活动第 6–10 课的目标　复习语法",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["li","- Asking about things around","- 询问周遭的事物",0],["li","- Asking/ Saying one's features","- 询问／说出某人的特征",0],["li","- Showing interest about something","- 对某事表示兴趣",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Vocabulary flash cards, calendar.","单词单词卡、月历。",0],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 10","EEC 3 第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","lion, elephant, zebra, tiger, monkey, crocodile, giraffe, turtle",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","What's this?","A",0],["d","It is a parrot.","B",0],["d","Is it dangerous?","A",0],["d","No, it's kind.","B",0],["d","It's colorful!","A",0],["d","And it can talk, too.","B",0],["d","Really?","A",0],["d","Yeah. It repeats after you.","B",0],["h2","Quiz Review (20 minutes)","小测验复习（20 分钟）",0],["p","Take the time to review with your class. Do oral practice, drill and extra board work. Also use the digital equipment to review for them. Have a copy of the quiz and go over each portion with your class. Let them do similar questions to those in the quiz, but not the same.","花时间和全班复习，做口语练习、操练和额外的白板练习，也用数字设备帮他们复习。拿一份小测验卷和全班逐部分讲评，让他们做和小测验类似但不相同的题目。",0],["h2","Quiz (30mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Clear unnecessary items from the desk and get students prepared to do the quiz. Separate the seating. Hand out the quiz and let them do it.","清掉桌上不需要的东西，让学生准备考试。把座位分开，发下考卷让他们作答。",0],["h2","Listening quiz (30mins)","听力小测验（30 分钟）",0],["p","Do a couple of listening exercises to \" warm up\" the students. Turn on the tape recorder and let them write down the answers.","先做几个听力练习让学生“热身”。打开录音机，让他们写下答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(5 mins)","（5 分钟）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","It is a good time to remind the students to correct mistakes they have made from all the previous homework.","这是提醒学生订正之前所有作业错误的好时机。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. It is a good time to give students reward cards according to their team's performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there is Test 2.","(3) 提醒学生有第 2 次考试。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["li","1. What are the seasons of the year? 2.What are the months of the year?","1. What are the seasons of the year?（一年有哪些季节？）2. What are the months of the year?（一年有哪些月份？）",0],["li","3. What season comes after spring?","3. What season comes after spring?（春天之后是什么季节？）",0],["li","4. What month comes after April? Do you have to clean your room on Sundays?","4. What month comes after April?（四月之后是几月？）Do you have to clean your room on Sundays?（你星期天必须打扫房间吗？）",0],["li","5. Turn to page 42. Let the students label the animals as dangerous, kind, thin, fat, big, and small.","5. 翻到第 42 页，让学生把动物标上 dangerous、kind、thin、fat、big、small。",0],["li","6. Group students in pairs and let them read the dialogue. They must each time substitute the word parrot with another animal's name.","6. 让学生两两一组念对话，每次都要把 parrot 换成另一种动物的名称。",0]],"g":[[20,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities lesson 6-10","＆","Readers","Lesson 6-8"]],[34,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":75},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[54],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["p","Classroom Readers 6 & Classroom Activities 6A/B Test lesson 4 to lesson 8, Test lesson 6 to lesson 10","课堂读本 6 与课堂活动 6A/B　考第 4 课到第 8 课、考第 6 课到第 10 课",0],["h2","Attendance and review (40 minutes)","点名与复习（40 分钟）",0],["p","Do a quick review of all the areas on the test. Include the sentence patterns, spelling, vocabulary, and IPA phonetics. After you have prepared them enough, get everyone settled down to write the test. You can play some games for reviewing.","快速复习考试的所有范围，包括句型、拼写、单词和国际音标。准备充分后，让大家安静下来写考卷。可以玩一些复习游戏。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The test is designed to take the entire class session. If the students should finish early, have them draw, read quietly, sleep or leave the classroom to watch TV.","考试设计为占用整堂课。如果学生提早写完，让他们画画、安静阅读、休息，或离开教室去看电视。",0],["h2","Oral test Time: 3-5 mins for every student","口试时间：每位学生 3–5 分钟",0],["p","The oral test should be conducted outside the classroom, individually with the students. Each question is worth four points, one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give the students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes. Assign a classroom leader to watch the class while you're conducting the oral test. The oral test is worth 20% of the test total.","口试应在教室外与学生个别进行。每题 4 分，理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。给学生自己改正错误的机会。进行口试时指派一位班长看管班级。口试占考试总分的 20%。",0],["h2","Oral Test 2","口试 2",0],["li","1. How many seasons are there in a year?","1. How many seasons are there in a year?（一年有几个季节？）",0],["li","2. What are the seasons of the year?","2. What are the seasons of the year?（一年有哪些季节？）",0],["li","3. Please say the months of the year?","3. Please say the months of the year?（请说出一年的月份。）",0],["li","4. What month comes after June?","4. What month comes after June?（六月之后是几月？）",0],["li","5. Do you have to sweep the floor?","5. Do you have to sweep the floor?（你必须扫地吗？）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","Progress report book.","进度报告本。",0],["li","1. Write down the quiz and listening grade on their report book and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Also ask them to write every mistake 5-10 times for the two quizzes","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中的每个错误写 5–10 次。",0],["li","2. Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[[2,["None"]],[6,["None"]],[14,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":60},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[55,56],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["p","Classroom Activities &Classroom Readers Review CA lesson 6 to lesson 10, review CR lesson 4 to lesson 8","课堂活动与课堂读本　复习 CA 第 6 课到第 10 课，复习 CR 第 4 课到第 8 课",0],["h2","Test Review (15 mins)","考试讲评（15 分钟）",0],["p","Give the test back to the students and go over the results with them. Emphasize any areas where there seemed to be mistakes. Do some drill work and games to reinforce skills","把考卷发还给学生，和他们一起讲评结果。强调错误较多的地方，做一些操练和游戏来加强技巧。",0],["h2","Field Trip Preparation (time: 35 mins)","户外教学准备（时间：35 分钟）",0],["p","New vocabulary: tissue, cookie, candy, chewing gum, battery, comic book, telephone card. Beverage, envelope, newspaper, magazine, toy.","新单词：tissue（纸巾）、cookie（饼干）、candy（糖果）、chewing gum（口香糖）、battery（电池）、comic book（漫画书）、telephone card（电话卡）、beverage（饮料）、envelope（信封）、newspaper（报纸）、magazine（杂志）、toy（玩具）。",0],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",0],["p","What are you looking for? I am looking for_________. Teaching materials: Field trip flash cards, some products from the convenience store like tissue, cookie, candy, etc. Field trips are fun, and they are a break from regular classroom routine. The field trip is a great learning experience. This field trip will be to the convenience store. Find a convenience store close to your school. Arrange with the manager or boss of the store beforehand.","What are you looking for?（你在找什么？）I am looking for_________.（我在找……）教材：户外教学单词卡、一些便利店的商品，如纸巾、饼干、糖果等。户外教学很有趣，能让学生跳脱平常的课堂例行公事，也是很棒的学习经验。这次户外教学要去便利店。找一家离学校近的便利店，事先和店长或老板安排好。",0],["h3","Classroom activity","课堂活动",0],["li","1. Introduce the new vocabulary. Show the cards to the children and let them repeat after you a couple of times.","1. 介绍新单词。给孩子们看单词卡，让他们跟着你念几次。",0],["li","2. Now, show the kids some of the products from the convenience store. Have them say the item and touch it. Then do the sentence pattern and first rehearse the question and answer with the students. Then let them speak individually. Let the student say the answer and the teacher asks the question. If the student answers correctly, she/he scores a point. Divide the class into two teams and see which team wins. Give a reward to the winning team.","2. 现在给孩子们看一些便利店的商品，让他们说出物品名称并摸一摸。接着练习句型，先和学生排练问答，再让他们个别说。学生说答案，老师问问题，答对的学生得一分。把全班分成两队，看哪一队赢，给获胜队伍奖励。",0],["h2","At the Convenience Store: (40 mins)","在便利店：（40 分钟）",0],["p","Now it's time for the class to move to the closest convenience store together in an orderly way. Remember, safety first. When you arrive at the convenience store, make sure there is enough discipline and the kids don't misbehave. Then go around and point at the different objects you have taught them. If they want something, they have to ask for it in English. They have to use the pattern, \"I'm looking for__________. I want to buy_______.\" Make sure everyone gets a speaking turn and chance to buy something. After everyone has bought something, it's time to go to school. Review Everything that was learned in class.","现在全班一起有秩序地走到最近的便利店。记住，安全第一。到了便利店，要确保秩序良好，孩子们不调皮。接着四处走走，指出你教过的各种物品。如果他们想要什么，必须用英语开口要，要用句型 \"I'm looking for__________. I want to buy_______.\"。确保每个人都有说话的机会和买东西的机会。大家都买完后就回学校，复习课堂上学过的所有内容。",0],["h2","Reinforcement(10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Check their progress report books and write comment in it. Give reward cards according to performance.","1. 检查他们的进度报告本并写评语，依表现发奖励卡。",0],["li","2. Tell the students to preview the next lesson and listen to the tapes at home.","2. 告诉学生在家预习下一课并听录音带。",0],["li","3. Remind students about the telephone teaching.","3. 提醒学生电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["p","1.Please say the seasons of the year. 2.Please say the months of the year. 3.What month comes before December? 4.What season comes before winter? 5.How do you spell November?","1. Please say the seasons of the year.（请说出一年的四季。）2. Please say the months of the year.（请说出一年的月份。）3. What month comes before December?（十二月之前是几月？）4. What season comes before winter?（冬天之前是什么季节？）5. How do you spell November?（November 怎么拼？）",0]],"g":[[2,["None"]],[4,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":65},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[57,58,59,60],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- Review goals from lesson 6 - 10","- 复习第 6–10 课的目标",1],["li","- Review grammar","- 复习语法",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Getting re-acquainted","- 重新熟悉彼此",1],["li","- Asking/ Talking about one's past","- 询问／谈论某人的过去",1],["li","- Expressing one's happiness to have someone's presence","- 表达有某人在身边的喜悦",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson11","课堂活动 6B 第 11 课",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Reviewing grammar structures in the sentence patterns lesson 6- 10 IPA symbols Review","复习第 6–10 课句型中的语法结构国际音标复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flash cards, calendar.","单词单词卡、月历。",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 11","EEC 3 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","lamp post, garden, taxi, traffic light, smoke, driver, mail box, postman",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hi, Brian. Long time no see!","A",1],["d","Jenny! I missed you!","B",1],["d","You haven't changed a bit.","A",1],["d","Neither have you.","B",1],["d","How have you been?","A",1],["d","Pretty good.","B",1],["d","It's very nice to have you here.","A",1],["d","I'm glad, too.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5 mins)","热身 Warm Up（5 mins）",0],["li","1. Review some of the previously learned words. Have some flashcards with the name of the months of the year. Show the cards to the class and let them read it once. Let the students have the flashcards. Then sing that song in which all the months of the year are named. When the song is sung, let every student who holds a particular month stand up when that month is named in the song.","1. 复习一些之前学过的单词。准备写有月份名称的单词卡，给全班看并念一次，再把单词卡发给学生。然后唱那首唱到所有月份的歌，唱到某个月份时，拿着那个月份的学生要站起来。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Make use of Lesson Seven. Let the students stand in a circle and let each one read one sentence, then touch his/her friend standing next to him/her and that person reads the next sentence. Proceed around the circle in one direction. Practice until this activity proceeds very quickly. Write some key words from the reading lesson on the board. Let the students close their Readers. Have a sticky ball ready and let someone take an aim at any key word on the board. That student must then throw the ball say the key word that's hit and also one sentence from the reader in which the key word occurs. Give all the students a chance to participate.","利用第七课。让学生站成一圈，每人念一句，再碰一下旁边的同学，由那位同学念下一句，沿着圆圈同一方向进行，练到很快为止。把读本里的几个关键字写在白板上，让学生合上读本。准备一颗黏黏球，让一位学生瞄准白板上任一个关键字丢球，说出打中的关键字，以及读本中含有这个字的一个句子。让所有学生都有机会参与。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: Lesson 11 (30 mins)","课堂活动：第 11 课（30 分钟）",0],["h3","Open the website (see column on the right)","打开网站（见右栏）",0],["p","Open the website and follow the guidance to go to the exercise listed on the right side of the page. When Classroom Activities 11.1 shows on the screen, then click on the relevant characters to listen to the dialogue produced by them. Do one sentence at a time and let the students first listen and then repeat the sentence as it is produced by the digital medium.","打开网站，依照指引进到页面右侧所列的练习。屏幕出现课堂活动 11.1 时，点击相关角色听他们的对话。一次一句，让学生先听，再照数字教材念出的句子跟着念。",0],["h3","Playing a game","玩游戏",0],["p","Black out the screen for a moment and do the following activity: hand out some picture cards to the students which indicate any specific activity which were mentioned earlier in the lesson and which they are familiar with such as \"play basketball\"or \"sweep the floor.\" The student with the activity card will stand up and select a partner. He/She will show the card to someone else and after studying the card the person have to ask a question about the activity; such as, \"Do you want to sweep the floor?\" The person with the card will answer, \"Yes, I want to sweep the floor.\" Continue until all the verbs are revised.","暂时关掉屏幕，进行下面的活动：发给学生一些图片卡，上面是课程前面提到过、他们熟悉的活动，例如 \"play basketball\" 或 \"sweep the floor\"。拿到活动卡的学生站起来选一位伙伴，把卡片给对方看，对方看完要针对这个活动提问，例如 \"Do you want to sweep the floor?\"。拿卡的人回答 \"Yes, I want to sweep the floor.\"。持续进行直到所有动词都复习过。",0],["h3","Open the website (see column on the right)","打开网站（见右栏）",0],["p","Show the students how to complete the matching exercise using the touchscreen all-in-one. They have to match the pictures with the words. Then repeat the exercise and give individual students a chance to do the matching and also show them how to click with the mouse beforehand. Let the whole class repeat the months associated with spring, summer, autumn and winter respectively by saying the names after each match. Then black out the screen and play a game to reinforce the knowledge.","用触控一体机示范如何完成配对练习，学生要把图和字配对。再重做一次，让个别学生有机会配对，事先示范如何用鼠标点击。每配对一次，就让全班跟着说出分别属于春、夏、秋、冬的月份。然后关掉屏幕玩个游戏加强记忆。",0],["h3","Play a game","玩游戏",0],["p","Hand the flashcards on which the months are written out to the students. Give each student one card. Again repeat which months are spring, summer, winter and autumn. Let the students who hold the cards for these months stand up respectively when the season's name is called. Then after the reinforcement, the activity is repeated, but very fast. When the teacher says, \"spring,\" then the students holding the cards for March, April and May must stand up. Repeat and do it faster every time. If a student makes a mistake, he or she is out. See who stays the longest in the game.","把写有月份的单词卡发给学生，每人一张。再重复一次哪些月份是春、夏、秋、冬。喊出季节名称时，拿着那些月份的学生要站起来。加强之后再重复这个活动，但要非常快。老师说 \"spring\" 时，拿三月、四月、五月的学生必须站起来。重复进行，每次都更快。学生出错就出局，看谁留到最后。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (10 minutes)","国际音标／自然拼读（10 分钟）",0],["h3","Open the website (see column on the right)","打开网站（见右栏）",0],["p","Direct the student's attention to the exercise on the screen and do the exercise by filling in the IPA symbols to complete the words. Afterwards let individual students point with the cursor to words on the screen and indicate which words have the same sound; let the student also say the words aloud while pointing to them.","引导学生注意屏幕上的练习，填入国际音标完成单词。之后让个别学生用游标指出屏幕上的单词，指出哪些字有相同的音，指的时候也要大声念出那些字。",0],["h3","Play a game","玩游戏",0],["p","Write some of the IPA symbols that you are reviewing for this lesson on the board. ( Use the vowel sounds.) Then say a few words which sound the same. One student must come to the board and point out the correct IPA symbol that can be heard in the words. Repeat more than once. See which of the students can do very well in this exercise.","把这一课要复习的几个国际音标写在白板上（用元音）。然后说几个发音相同的字，请一位学生到白板前指出字中听到的正确国际音标。重复几次，看哪些学生这个练习做得很好。",0],["h3","Activity sheet No. 6","活动单 6",0],["p","Have the students complete the Activity Sheet No. 6","让学生完成活动单 6。",0],["h2","EEC (15mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in Lesson One. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","Do you feel happy about seeing someone you miss? What will you say when you see a person you haven't seen for a long time? Let's listen to the conversation between Brian and Jenny.","见到想念的人你会开心吗？见到很久没见的人你会说什么？我们来听听 Brian 和 Jenny 的对话。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(10 mins)","（10 mins）",0],["p","Review today's lesson. Review what the students have learned using the classroom activity books.","复习今天的课程。用课堂活动书复习学生学过的内容。",0],["h3","Homework Exercises","家庭作业",0],["p","Take the time to preview the homework. Find one example from the book and explain it on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding about how to do the homework.","花时间预习作业。从书中找一个例子在白板上讲解，让他们对作业怎么做有些概念。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 11","11.1","11.3","11.4"]],[63,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":80},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[61,62,63,64],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- To express future plans","- 表达未来的计划",1],["li","- Review grammar","- 复习语法",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Getting re-acquainted","- 重新熟悉彼此",1],["li","- Asking/ talking about one's past","- 询问／谈论某人的过去",1],["li","- Expressing one's happiness to have someone's presence","- 表达有某人在身边的喜悦",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson9","课堂读本第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","neat, will, hear, fly, wrong, invisible",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","won't = will not","won't = will not（不会）",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson 12","课堂活动 6B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","neat, hear, fly, wrong, invisible, will, won't = will not, tomorrow morning, tomorrow afternoon, tomorrow night, the day after tomorrow",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","won't = will not IPA symbols Review symbols from lesson 6 - 10","won't = will not　国际音标复习第 6–10 课的音标",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flash cards, calendar.","单词单词卡、月历。",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 11","EEC 3 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","lamp post, garden, taxi, traffic light, smoke, driver, mail box, postman",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hi, Brian. Long time no see!","A",1],["d","Jenny! I missed you!","B",1],["d","You haven't changed a bit.","A",1],["d","Neither have you.","B",1],["d","How have you been?","A",1],["d","Pretty good.","B",1],["d","It's very nice to have you here.","A",1],["d","I'm glad, too.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Introduce the new words and show how to spell them. Pronounce every word clearly and let the class repeat after you. Erase some letters from certain words and let individual students fill in letters. When they fill in a letter, they must say the words as well. Give everyone a chance. Then erase the words from the board. Choose two leaders to act as little teachers. Each little teacher has a list of all the new vocabulary. Each of them takes turns and calls on students from the class to spell a word on the board. If the student can spell the word, he/she can go and sit down. If they cannot spell the word, they become a student of the little teacher who called on them to spell the word. See which little teacher has collected the most students in the end.","介绍新单词并示范拼法。清楚念出每个字，让全班跟着念。把某些字擦掉几个字母，让个别学生填上，填的时候也要念出整个字。让每个人都有机会。然后擦掉白板上的字。选两位领袖当小老师，每位小老师拿一张所有新单词的清单，轮流叫班上的学生到白板上拼一个字。拼对的学生可以回座位；拼不出来的就成为叫他的那位小老师的学生。最后看哪位小老师收了最多学生。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Find the location of the reading lesson on the Jordan's website by following the instructions in the column on the right. Open it and just before starting to play the reading part, click on the 'stop' button to freeze the picture and focus the attention of the class. See how many objects in the picture can the students name. Then click on the play button and view the complete lesson. After this black out the screen and then let the students open their books to read the lesson aloud together once. Then divide the group in two teams and give them turns to answer comprehension questions. Ask questions such as, \"Who is on the sofa?\" etc. See which team can win by having the most questions answered correctly. Open the website so that the text in the exercise is displayed. Focus the attention on it and see who can read the sentences on the screen. Start with the first sentence and see who volunteers to do it. After the reading of a sentence by an individual student, click on the \"voice\" button so that the recorded sentence is read and the students can make out the correct pronunciation and tone by paying attention to the digital medium. Then let everyone repeat it. It is important to let the students read first before they listen to the recorded voice. However, when there are no volunteers to read a sentence, play the recorded sentence first by clicking on the particular icon. Then let a student who volunteers repeat the sentence that was just played by the digital medium in class.","依右栏的指示在乔登网站上找到阅读课的位置。打开后，在开始播放阅读部分之前按“停止”键定住画面，集中全班注意力。看学生能说出图中多少东西的名称。然后按播放看完整课。之后关掉屏幕，让学生打开书一起大声念一次。再把学生分成两队，轮流回答理解问题，例如 \"Who is on the sofa?\" 等。看哪一队答对最多题获胜。打开网站显示练习中的课文，集中注意力，看谁能念出屏幕上的句子。从第一句开始，看谁自愿念。学生念完一句后，点“声音”按钮播放录好的句子，让学生注意数字教材，听出正确的发音和语调，然后让大家跟着念。重要的是先让学生念，再听录音。不过，没有人自愿念时，就先点图示播放录音，再让自愿的学生重复刚才播放的句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: Lesson 12 (25mins)","课堂活动：第 12 课（25 分钟）",0],["p","Display the calendar and talk to the class about the date and perhaps the time (morning, afternoon or evening). Show where is 'today' on the calendar and also where is \"tomorrow.\" Make sure everyone knows what month it is and specifically what day it is. Have some activity cards ready that you can hand out. Every card should show an activity that the students are familiar with such as \"play baseball,\" \"play ping-pong,\" or \"read a book.\" Then give the students one example of how to do the classroom game by taking a card, and pointing to the date of 'tomorrow', look at the activity on the card, and for instance if it shows swimming, then say, \"Tomorrow I will go swimming\". When you say this everyone must nod the head up and down to indicate yes. Any person who does not do the nodding is out. The teacher should indicate the activity by nodding first. Then you say the sentence again, but this time saying, \"Tomorrow I won't go swimming.\" (Also this time indicate \"no\" by shaking the head.) Anyone who is too slow to join the 'head shaking' is out, once again. When the students understand how the game works, give one student a card to make a sentence, following the example set by the teacher. Again see who is slow to move their heads indicating positive or negative when the sentence is said and that person is out. See who can stay the longest in the game. Give a reward to the best participants, and students who can use the new sentence pattern correctly.","展示月历，和全班谈谈日期，或许也谈谈时间（早上、下午或晚上）。指出月历上的“今天”和“明天”在哪里，确定大家都知道现在是几月、确切是哪一天。准备一些可以发下去的活动卡，每张卡上是学生熟悉的活动，例如 \"play baseball\"、\"play ping-pong\" 或 \"read a book\"。然后示范课堂游戏的玩法：拿一张卡，指着月历上“明天”的日期，看卡上的活动，例如是游泳，就说 \"Tomorrow I will go swimming.\"。说的时候大家要点头表示 yes，没点头的人出局，老师要先点头示范。接着再说一次句子，但这次说 \"Tomorrow I won't go swimming.\"（这次摇头表示 no），跟不上摇头的人一样出局。学生了解玩法后，发一张卡给一位学生，照老师的示范造句。同样看谁在听到句子时点头或摇头太慢就出局，看谁留到最后。给表现最好的人以及能正确使用新句型的学生奖励。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (10 minutes)","国际音标／自然拼读（10 分钟）",0],["p","Open the page on the right place on the website, use the instructions given in the column on the right. Click on each picture and let the students repeat the words after the voice that says it when the digital medium is played. Firstly black out the screen and then play a game with the students. Write the IPA symbols that appear in the exercise on digital. Write all the symbols on the board. Choose two students and give each one a plastic hammer. Then let them come to the front of the classroom facing the other students along with the teacher. The teacher says two words with the same sound (it must be one of the sounds written on the board). Then the students with the hammers must pound on the correct symbol that corresponds with the sound heard in the words. The student with the faster, correct response is the winner.","依右栏的指示打开网站到正确的页面。点击每张图，让学生跟着数字教材播放的声音念单词。接着先关掉屏幕，和学生玩个游戏：把数字练习中出现的国际音标全部写在白板上。选两位学生，每人发一支塑料锤，让他们到教室前面，和老师一起面向其他学生。老师说两个有相同音的字（必须是白板上写的其中一个音），拿锤子的学生要敲打和字中听到的音相符的正确音标。反应较快又正确的学生获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and repeat the following intonation contour.","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour>\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teacher can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(1) Listen and connect to \"the street\"","(1) 听一听，连到“the street（街道）”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","Look at the picture. What can you see on the street? There are taxies, traffic lights and lamp posts. Please turn to page 46. Let's Check. Listen to the words and connect them to \"the street\". Let's practice the words together.","看看这张图。你在街上可以看到什么？有出租车、红绿灯和路灯。请翻到第 46 页。Let's Check。听单词，把它们连到“the street”。我们一起练习这些单词。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3)Exercise: Label the pictures","(3) 练习：为图片标上名称",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement(10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["p","Review Homework Exercises. Refer to the homework books. Take one specific example from the homework exercise and do it as example on the board.","讲评家庭作业。参考作业本，从作业练习中挑一个具体例子在白板上示范。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["li","1. Please say the seasons of the year.","1. Please say the seasons of the year.（请说出一年的四季。）",0],["li","2. Please say the months of the year.","2. Please say the months of the year.（请说出一年的月份。）",0],["li","3. What month comes before December?","3. What month comes before December?（十二月之前是几月？）",0],["li","4. Make a sentence with \"will\".","4. 用 \"will\" 造一个句子。",0],["li","5. Make a sentence with \"won't\".","5. 用 \"won't\" 造一个句子。",0]],"g":[[34,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","classroom readers","Lesson 9","learning and","playing"]],[36,["Big kids","lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson12","12.2A","12.3C"]],[68,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":90},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[65,66,67,68],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- To talk about free time activities.","- 谈论空闲时的活动。",1],["li","- To ask questions and answer questions about future plans.","- 问答关于未来计划的问题。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Talking about a game","- 谈论一场比赛",1],["li","- Cheering","- 加油欢呼",1],["li","- Complimenting others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Agreeing/ congratulating","- 表示同意／恭喜",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 10","Classroom Readers 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Miss Meany, kick, mean, idea.",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Will you/he/she....?","Will you/he/she....?（你／他／她会……吗？）",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson13","课堂活动 6B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","No new vocabulary","没有新单词",1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Will you /he/she/they.....? IPA symbols [s ], [z] sounds","Will you /he/she/they.....?　国际音标 [s ]、[z] 音",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","New vocabulary flash cards","新单词单词卡",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 11","EEC 3 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","lamp post, garden, taxi, traffic light, smoke, driver, mail box, postman",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hi, Brian. Long time no see!","A",1],["d","Jenny! I missed you!","B",1],["d","You haven't changed a bit.","A",1],["d","Neither have you.","B",1],["d","How have you been?","A",1],["d","Pretty good.","B",1],["d","It's very nice to have you here.","A",1],["d","I'm glad, too.","B",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Open the website page to where you can find the new words. (See the column on the right.) Show the first picture, and let everyone listen to the sounding of the word/phrase by the speaker. Then let everyone repeat once. Go to the second picture and follow the same procedure, until you have covered all the new vocabulary. Now turn off the loudspeakers and show the pictures on the digital medium one more time. Let the kids in class raise their hands if they can say the word or phrase that belongs to the picture.","打开网站到新单词的页面（见右栏）。展示第一张图，让大家听喇叭念出的单词／短语，然后全体跟着念一次。到第二张图照同样程序，直到所有新单词都介绍完。现在关掉喇叭，在数字教材上再展示一次图片，会说出图片对应单词或短语的孩子举手。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Let the students open their Readers on page 32 and then play learning part of lesson 10 once. Let the students follow the pictures and text on the digital medium while they listen as well. Ask a few questions to test the listening comprehension of the students. Divide the class in two teams and see who can answer the most questions. The questions to be asked must be prepared in advance. Ask, for example, questions like,\" Who is a mean old woman?\" or \"Where are the kids playing ball?\" Open the books and go through the story. Let the whole group read aloud once and then let individual students read aloud as well. Make sure everyone gets a turn.","让学生打开读本第 32 页，播放一次第 10 课的学习部分。让学生一边听，一边看数字教材上的图和文字。问几个问题测试学生的听力理解。把全班分成两队，看谁答对最多题。问题要事先准备，例如 \"Who is a mean old woman?\" 或 \"Where are the kids playing ball?\"。打开书看一遍故事，让全班大声念一次，再让个别学生大声念，确定每个人都轮到。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: (30 mins)","课堂活动（30 分钟）",0],["p","Open the website again. See the column on the right for the correct place. You are going to click on the icons to listen to the dialogue. First, pair the students off and make five pairs. Let the first pair come to the front and then click on number one to listen to the first two sentences of dialogue. The two students in the front must repeat the sentences said by the characters on the screen. The teacher can indicate who must say the first sentence by, for instance, saying, \"Yes, go John.\" Make sure the first example is done correctly so that the next two pupils know what is expected. Call the next pair and follow the same procedure. Say the words of the dialogue first before attempting to type in words in the spaces. The teacher quickly types in the words in the spaces (if there is any) after the dialogue was listened to and spoken by the students and perhaps give one or two students the chance to type a word or two at the end of the exercise.","再打开网站，正确位置见右栏。你要点击图示来听对话。先让学生两两一组，组成五组。让第一组到前面，点第一题听前两句对话。前面的两位学生要重复屏幕上角色说的句子。老师可以指定谁说第一句，例如说 \"Yes, go John.\"。确定第一个示范做对，让下一组知道要做什么。叫下一组并照同样程序进行。在空格输入字之前，先把对话说出来。学生听完并说完对话后，老师迅速在空格输入字（如果有空格的话），练习最后也可以让一两位学生输入一两个字。",0],["h3","Daily planner worksheet","每日计划表练习纸",0],["p","Monday Thursday Tuesday Friday Wednesday Saturday, Sunday",null,0],["li","1. Give your class a copy of the Daily Planner worksheet, one per student. Tell them to think of one thing that they will do one each day of the week. They should then write down the activity on their planner. They have to fill in one activity for each day of the week. Every student works individually at this stage.","1. 给全班每人一张每日计划表练习纸。告诉他们想一件一周中每天要做的事，写在计划表上，每天都要填一个活动。这个阶段每位学生各自进行。",0],["li","2. The teacher can start the next step by asking one student the following question, for example. \"Jenny, what will you do on Monday?\"","2. 老师开始下一步，例如问一位学生：\"Jenny, what will you do on Monday?\"",0],["li","3. The students who answer the question look on the activity sheet (Monday) and answer, for instance, \"I will listen to music on Monday.\"","3. 回答问题的学生看活动单（星期一）回答，例如 \"I will listen to music on Monday.\"",0],["li","4. The object of the game is to find two students who have the same activity on the same day. These two students can score a point. See who scores the most points at the end.","4. 游戏的目标是找出同一天有相同活动的两位学生，这两位学生可以得一分。最后看谁得分最多。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (10 mins)","国际音标／自然拼读（10 分钟）",0],["p","The teacher opens the website to do the IPA phonetic part. (See the column on the right). The teacher clicks on number one and focus the attention of learners on the screen. (Turn off the loudspeaker) The teacher read the first two words and place emphasis on the [s] or [z] sound at the end of the words. Then let the students choose which phonetic spelling is correct. The teacher ask the student's choice and click on that option. See if it is correct and go to question number two. Follow the same procedure each time until the exercise is completed.","老师打开网站做国际音标部分（见右栏）。老师点第一题，让学习者注意屏幕（关掉喇叭）。老师念出前两个字，强调词尾的 [s] 或 [z] 音，然后让学生选择哪个音标拼法正确。老师问学生的选择并点击那个选项，看是否正确，再进到第二题。每次都照同样程序，直到完成练习。",0],["h3","Play a game","玩游戏",0],["p","Call out a student's name and have him/her spell a word that he/she has already learned. Spelling hot rock. Have the plastic ball. Set a count down for a minute or two. Give the ball to the student and say a word. The student has to spell the word, says another word and pass the ball to a classmate. That student has to spell the word and say another before passing the ball again. Keep passing the ball until everyone has had a turn. Activity sheet:","叫一位学生的名字，让他／她拼一个已经学过的字。拼写烫手山芋：准备塑料球，设定一两分钟倒数。把球交给学生并说一个字，学生要拼出这个字，再说另一个字并把球传给同学。那位同学要拼出那个字，说另一个字后再传球。一直传到每个人都轮过。活动单：",0],["p","Complete Activity Sheet Number 11.","完成活动单 11。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson one. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","Do you like to watch basketball games? What's your favorite basketball team? Let us join the game together. Are you ready? Let's go.","你喜欢看篮球比赛吗？你最喜欢哪支篮球队？我们一起加入比赛吧。准备好了吗？出发！",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Preview the homework. Refer to the digital exercise on the right to show the students their homework. Do one or two examples in the class.","1. 预习作业。参考右边的数字练习给学生看他们的作业，在课堂上做一两个例子。",0],["li","2. Use Progress Report Book to inform the parents of their child's progress.","2. 用进度报告本告知家长孩子的进度。",0]],"g":[[35,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[35,["Book 6","Classroom","Readers","Lesson 10","learning part"]],[37,["Big kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 13","13.1","new vocabulary"]],[45,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 13"]],[45,["13.3A","Playing a game","13.4 C","13.2"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[69,70,71,72],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- To express future plans Review grammar","- 表达未来的计划　复习语法",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Talking about a game","- 谈论一场比赛",1],["li","- Cheering","- 加油欢呼",1],["li","- Complimenting others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Agreeing/ congratulating Classroom Reader Lesson11","- 表示同意／恭喜　课堂读本第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","take off, glasses, chocolate, cookies, fly, flying",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Be going to + verb","Be going to + 动词",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson 14","课堂活动 6B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","take off, glasses, cookies, borrow a book, mail a letter, see the doctor, buy chocolate cookies",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Be going to + verb IPA symbols [s], [z], [ɪz]","Be going to + 动词国际音标 [s]、[z]、[ɪz]",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","New vocabulary flashcards, photocopies of the classroom reader lesson eleven","新单词单词卡、课堂读本第十一课的复印件",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 12","EEC 3 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","team, goal, court, score, stadium, player, referee, uniform",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Go! Go!","A",1],["d","What a game!","B",1],["d","Another goal!","A",1],["d","Yes. Give me five!","B",1],["d","The Tigers are the best.","A",1],["d","Definitely!","B",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Open the website on the place indicated in the column on the right hand side.(14.1)Then turn the sound off and flash the pictures to the class. Say all the new vocabulary and let the class repeat after you every time. Then show an appropriate action for every word. Let the class mime the actions as well. Play a short game. First black out the screen and divide the Classroom into two teams. One team mimes the actions and the other team has to say the phrase indicating what action it is. If the other team can say the words, they get the point. If not, the team that mimes the action can get the point.","打开网站到右栏所指的位置（14.1）。关掉声音，向全班快速展示图片。念出所有新单词，每次都让全班跟着念。然后为每个字示范适当的动作，让全班也比出动作。玩个小游戏：先关掉屏幕，把全班分成两队。一队比动作，另一队要说出代表那个动作的短语。说对的队伍得分；说不出来的话，比动作的队伍得分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Go to the particular page on the website and start to play the reading lesson. Click on the mouse to freeze the picture on the part where Simon appears in Miss Meany's kitchen. Then ask a few questions (prepared beforehand) to help students get a better grasp on the word \"invisible\". Ask, for example, \"Is Miss Meany going to see Simon?\" or \"Is the cat going to see Simon?\" Play the rest of the lesson and then ask a few questions where the students are only required to say \"yes\" or \"no.\" For example, ask \"Are the cookies flying?\" or \"Is the cat flying?\" etc. Give rewards to the students who can answer correctly.","到网站上的指定页面开始播放阅读课。在 Simon 出现在 Miss Meany 厨房的地方按鼠标定住画面，然后问几个（事先准备好的）问题，帮助学生更理解 \"invisible\" 这个字。例如问 \"Is Miss Meany going to see Simon?\" 或 \"Is the cat going to see Simon?\"。播完剩下的课程后，再问几个只需要回答 \"yes\" 或 \"no\" 的问题，例如 \"Are the cookies flying?\" 或 \"Is the cat flying?\" 等。答对的学生给予奖励。",0],["h3","Game/activity","游戏／活动",0],["p","Classroom Reader Reconstruction Make some photocopies of the story in the classroom reader. Cut the story into pieces. Divide the class into two teams. Have the teams reconstruct the story without using their books. The first team to finish reconstructing the story correctly wins.","课堂读本重组：把课堂读本的故事复印几份，剪成碎片。把全班分成两队，让各队不看书重组故事。最先正确重组完故事的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: Lesson 14 (25mins)","课堂活动：第 14 课（25 分钟）",0],["p","Look up the website and click on the first sentence of the exercise. Let the students look at the screen to see what action each character is going to do. Do the first example by letting both the answer and question play on the digital medium. (I will visit friends tomorrow. /I am going to visit friends tomorrow.) Let the student change the sentences from \"will\" to \"going to\" in each case. Click on the mouse to play the next sentence every time and let individual students give the answers. After they have said the answers, click on the mouse for the sounds so everyone can hear the proper pronunciation of the given answer. Also type in the answers quickly if possible, but type it in after it was given by the student. Have the new vocabulary flashcards ready. Use the following cards: library, bakery, Hospital, Post office, Park. Introduce the words by saying the word and showing the picture card. Then let the students repeat after you. Place the different cards on the four classroom walls and let two students volunteer do be the first contestants in the game. Let the two students be blindfolded and call out one of the words. See who can touch the correct picture card first. If the student touches the wrong card, he/she is out and have to sit down.","打开网站，点练习的第一句。让学生看屏幕上每个角色要做什么动作。第一个例子让数字教材把答案和问题都播出来（I will visit friends tomorrow. / I am going to visit friends tomorrow.）。让学生把每个句子从 \"will\" 改成 \"going to\"。每次按鼠标播放下一句，让个别学生回答。说完答案后按鼠标播放声音，让大家听到答案的正确发音。可以的话也迅速输入答案，但要在学生说出之后再输入。准备好新单词单词卡，使用这些卡：library、bakery、Hospital、Post office、Park。说出单词并展示图片卡来介绍，让学生跟着念。把不同的卡片贴在教室四面墙上，让两位自愿的学生当游戏的第一批参赛者。蒙住两位学生的眼睛，喊出其中一个字，看谁先摸到正确的图片卡。摸错卡片的学生出局，要坐下。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (15 mins)","国际音标／自然拼读（15 分钟）",0],["p","Open the website on the correct place as indicated on the right. Turn off the sound and show the first option picture to the students, also say the word and let the students repeat. Then let them indicate their choice as to which phonetic symbol is the correct one to go with the particular word. Then click on that option and let the students see if their choice was correct. After this, go on to the next answer and complete the exercise.","依右栏的指示打开网站到正确位置。关掉声音，给学生看第一张选项图，念出单词让学生跟着念。然后让他们指出哪个音标和这个字相符，再点击那个选项，让学生看看自己选的对不对。接着进到下一题，完成练习。",0],["h3","Play a game","玩游戏",0],["p","The Pizza Spelling, Question/Answer game. This game is divided into two parts. The first part is a question/answer part and the second part is a spelling part. Draw two big pizzas on the board and divide them into 16 slices. Divide the class into two teams. Hold up a flashcard, ask a question using the sentence pattern and have them answer. If they answer correctly, they get the opportunity to spell a word. To get points in this game, they have to spell a word using the last letter of a word you choose. For instance, if you say cat, they have to spell a word that starts with \"t\". If they choose a word like teacher, they can move 7 spaces ahead on the pizza.","披萨拼写问答游戏。这个游戏分两部分：第一部分是问答，第二部分是拼写。在白板上画两个大披萨，各切成 16 片。把全班分成两队。举起一张单词卡，用句型问问题让他们回答。答对的话就有机会拼一个字。要在游戏中得分，必须用你选的字的最后一个字母拼出一个新字。例如你说 cat，他们就要拼一个以 \"t\" 开头的字。如果他们选了像 teacher 这样的字，就可以在披萨上前进 7 格。",0],["d","Complete Activity Sheet Number 12","Activity Sheet",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teacher needs to have the students to do the intonation practice by listening and repeating after you for exercise 1 and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2 .For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师要让学生听并跟着您复诵，练习语调；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1)Listen and repeat the following intonation contour.","(1) 听一听，跟着念出以下的语调",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying\" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to listen to the teacher and repeat the intonation contour.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the exercise to the students and have them to listen to you carefully and repeat after you. (The teacher can read the exercise to the class again if it's necessary.)","念出练习内容，请学生仔细听并跟着您复诵。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）",0],["h3","(2) Listen and connect to \"the stadium\"","(2) 听一听，连到“the stadium（体育场）”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","We can always see people cheer for their favorite teams at the stadium. What else can we see there? Let's have a look. Please turn tom page 50. Let's Check. Listen and connect the words to the stadium.","我们常在体育场看到人们为喜欢的队伍加油。那里还能看到什么？我们来看看。请翻到第 50 页。Let's Check。听一听，把单词和体育场连起来。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to check the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["li","(3) Exercise: Look at the picture and write the amount of each one","(3) 练习：看图写出每样东西的数量",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["li","Step 7:","步骤 7：",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["p","Write the learning items on the board and let the students write it down on their progress report books. Homework on digital. ( see for your reference the column on the right) Take some time to preview the homework and show the students one or two examples and how it should be done.","把学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进进度报告本。数字作业（参考右栏）：花点时间预习作业，给学生看一两个例子并示范怎么做。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching Material 10:","电话教学教材 10：",0],["li","1. Will you visit your friends on Saturday?","1. Will you visit your friends on Saturday?（你星期六会去拜访朋友吗？）",0],["li","2. Will your mother and father listen to music on Friday?","2. Will your mother and father listen to music on Friday?（你爸妈星期五会听音乐吗？）",0],["li","3. How do you spell chocolate?","3. How do you spell chocolate?（chocolate 怎么拼？）",0],["li","4. Make a sentence with \"going to.\"","4. 用 \"going to\" 造一个句子。",0]],"g":[[31,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom Readers","Lesson 11","playing and learning"]],[35,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activity","Lesson 14","14.1","14.2B","Playing a game","Lesson 14","14.3D","14.3 B , 14.3C"]],[70,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[73,74,75],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA","CR/CA（课堂读本／课堂活动）",1],["li","- To identify food, to order in a restaurant","- 认识食物，在餐厅点餐",1],["li","- To ask others about future plans.","- 询问别人未来的计划。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Talking about a game","- 谈论一场比赛",1],["li","- Cheering","- 加油欢呼",1],["li","- Complimenting others","- 称赞别人",1],["li","- Agreeing/ congratulating Classroom Reders Lesson12","- 表示同意／恭喜　课堂读本第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","other, living room, move, ghost, anything, rest",null,1],["h3","sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","The \"be going to\" pattern","\"be going to\" 句型",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 6B Lesson 15","课堂活动 6B 第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","steak, pork chops, seafood, salad.",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Am/are/is__________ going to _______? IPA symbols Short vowels.","Am/are/is__________ going to _______?（……要……吗？）国际音标短元音。",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","New vocabulary flashcards, two sticky balls, have the picture cards of the words in exercise 15.4(ball, ten, pig, shop, bus.) Also have the IPA vowel sounds of the words written separately on cards.","新单词单词卡、两颗黏黏球、练习 15.4 单词的图片卡（ball、ten、pig、shop、bus），另外把这些字的国际音标元音分别写在卡片上。",1],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 12","EEC 3 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","team, goal, court, score, stadium, player, referee, uniform",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Go! Go!","A",1],["d","What a game!","B",1],["d","Another goal!","A",1],["d","Yes, Give me five!","B",1],["d","The Tigers are the best.","A",1],["d","Definitely!","B",1],["d","Yes, give me five!","B",1],["d","The Tigers are the best.","A",1],["d","Definitely!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Review the previous words by playing a game. Hand out the vocabulary cards so that each of the students have at least two cards. The must keep the cards in such a way that nobody can see which card they have. Then one volunteer starts the game. He/She chooses any other student to ask the following question for example: \"John, do you have the bakery?\" If 'John' says \"yes,\" then the person who asked him must spell the word and collect the card from him. He only has to hand over his card the other student spelled the word correctly. See who has the most cards in the end. Look at the vocabulary on the screen via the digital medium. Turn of the sound at first and let the students say the words if there are any of the words they do know yet. Then afterwards play the sound with the pictures and let the students repeat the words every time.","玩游戏复习之前的单词。发下单词卡，每位学生至少两张，卡片要拿好不让别人看到。由一位志愿者开始游戏，他／她选任一位同学问，例如：\"John, do you have the bakery?\"。如果 John 说 \"yes\"，提问的人就要拼出那个字，并向他收走卡片。只有对方拼对时，他才要交出卡片。最后看谁的卡片最多。通过数字教材看屏幕上的单词。一开始先关掉声音，让学生说出他们已经会的字。之后再配合图片播放声音，每次都让学生跟着念。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Play a game before starting the reading lesson. Open the website to the page where the new words are displayed. Let the students open their books (Lesson 12). Click on the first word and let everyone repeat the word. Then see who can first find the sentence in which the word occurs in the reading lesson. The teacher can then say the sentence and let the student score a point. Play the game until all the new words are covered. See who is the winner. Play the learning part of the lesson and let the students listen and view the pictures on the screen. Then let everyone open the readers and read the lesson through once together. Divide the class into two teams and give every team three questions to ask the other team about the lesson. (Use the questions given on P.41. Lesson 15) Give a reward to the winning team, such as letting each of them read a few sentences from the lesson aloud in the class.","开始阅读课之前先玩个游戏。打开网站到显示新单词的页面，让学生打开书（第 12 课）。点第一个字让大家跟着念，然后看谁最先在课文中找到含有这个字的句子。老师念出那个句子，让那位学生得一分。玩到所有新单词都找过，看谁是赢家。播放这课的学习部分，让学生听并看屏幕上的图。然后大家打开读本一起把课文念一遍。把全班分成两队，每队给三个关于课文的问题去问另一队（用第 41 页第 15 课的问题）。给获胜队伍奖励，例如让每位队员在班上大声念几句课文。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: (30 mins)","课堂活动（30 分钟）",0],["p","Pair the students off and give every pair a number (one to seven). Divide the pairs into teams. Open the website at the page indicated on the right and call the first pair from say, team one. When you click on the icon let the sound of number one play. The first student in the couple repeat the sentence he/she just heard. (That is the question part of number one). Click on the answer part of number one and let the second student of the pair repeat that sentence. Then black out the screen totally and ask the couple to repeat the question and answer part of number one without any help from the digital medium. Give a point for every correct response and see which team can get the highest score. Divide the board into two halves. On the one halve of the board, write only the verbs used in the chapter such as eat, have, taste, and drink. On the other halve of the board, write the names of different types of food such as \"pork chops\", etc. Ask for one volunteer (as example) and hand two sticky balls to him/her. He/She has to throw the ball onto each half of the board, hitting a verb and noun. The verb and noun have to be used together in the sentence pattern and the student can score a point. For instance, the student making a hit on \"eat\" and \"ice cream\" must say, \" I am going to eat ice cream.\" Then divide the class into two teams and give the members of teams the opportunity to compete. See which team scores the most points.","让学生两两一组，每组一个号码（一到七），再把各组分成队伍。打开网站到右边所指的页面，叫第一组，例如第一队的。点图示播放第一题的声音，组中第一位学生重复刚听到的句子（这是第一题的问句部分）。点第一题的答句部分，让组中第二位学生重复那句。然后完全关掉屏幕，请这组不靠数字教材重复第一题的问句和答句。每答对一次得一分，看哪一队得分最高。把白板分成两半，一半只写这一章用到的动词，如 eat、have、taste、drink；另一半写各种食物名称，如 \"pork chops\" 等。请一位志愿者（作为示范），交给他／她两颗黏黏球，他／她要往白板两半各丢一颗，打中一个动词和一个名词。这个动词和名词要一起用在句型里，学生就能得一分。例如打中 \"eat\" 和 \"ice cream\" 的学生要说 \"I am going to eat ice cream.\"。然后把全班分成两队让队员比赛，看哪一队得分最多。",0],["h2","IPA Symbols/phonics (10 mins)","国际音标／自然拼读（10 分钟）",0],["p","Page to the website location shown on the right. Turn off the sound and let the student pronounce the vocabulary they can see in the picture. The teacher can say the word first if the students cannot pronounce it. Let students make a choice and pick the correct IPA symbol for the word. Then click on the answer chosen by the students and see if it is correct. After this, go to the next question. After completing the exercises on the digital site, do the following:","翻到右边所示的网站位置。关掉声音，让学生念出图中看到的单词。学生念不出来时，老师可以先念。让学生为这个字选出正确的国际音标，再点击学生选的答案看是否正确，然后进到下一题。完成数字网站上的练习后，进行下面的活动：",0],["h3","Play a game","玩游戏",0],["p","Take the vocabulary cards and the cards with IPA symbols and put them in two different piles. The first student volunteering to be first picks up one card from each pile. The student names the picture on the vocabulary card. Next the student looks at the IPA symbol on the second card and has to say whether the symbol corresponds with the sound heard from saying the word on the vocabulary card. If the answer is correct, he/she scores a mark. See who can score more marks in this exercise. Activity sheet: complete Activity Sheet Number 13.","把单词卡和国际音标卡分成两叠。第一位自愿的学生从每叠各抽一张，说出单词卡上图片的名称，接着看第二张卡上的国际音标，说出这个音标是否和念那个字时听到的音相符。答对就得一分，看谁在这个练习中得分最多。活动单：完成活动单 13。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","Let the students listen to the MP3 sounds and let them read the dialogue from their books after this. Invent one action for each phrase in the dialogue. (Make use of the suggestions in the manual or invent your own) Teach the actions. Then let students who volunteers, perform in front of the class. Do teach the following actions for the dialogue:","让学生听 MP3 的声音，之后让他们念课本上的对话。为对话中的每个短语设计一个动作（参考手册中的建议或自己设计），教学生这些动作，然后让自愿的学生在全班面前表演。请教下面这些对话动作：",0],["d","Go! Go! (Fist in the air)","A",0],["d","What a game! (Clutch your head)","B",0],["d","Another goal! (Clap your hands together)","A",0],["d","Yes, give me five! (Usual gesture for five)","B",0],["d","The tigers are the best. (Thumbs-up sign)","A",0],["d","Definitely!(Pat on the back)","B",0],["h2","Reinforcement (5 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（5 mins）",0],["h3","Review","复习",0],["p","Review the contents of today's lessons using the activities book.","用活动书复习今天的课程内容。",0],["h3","Homework","作业",0],["p","Preview the digital homework exercise. Do one example to guide the students","预习数字作业练习。做一个例子引导学生。",0],["h3","Progress Reports","进度报告",0],["p","Write the learning items on the board and let the students write it in their progress report books.","把学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进进度报告本。",0]],"g":[[35,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Readers","Lesson 12","New Words"]],[37,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 15","15.1","15.2A","Playing a game"]],[39,["Big Kids","Lesson IV","Book 6","Classroom","Activities","Lesson 15","15.4A, 15.4 B"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[76,77],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["li","-To review vocabulary for the test","- 为考试复习单词",0],["li","-To use the future tense.","- 使用将来时。",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["li","- Talking about a game","- 谈论一场比赛",0],["li","- Cheering","- 加油欢呼",0],["li","- Complimenting others","- 称赞别人",0],["li","- Agreeing/ congratulating","- 表示同意／恭喜",0],["h3","EEC 3 Lesson 12","EEC 3 第 12 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","team, goal, court, score, stadium, player, referee, uniform",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","Go! Go!","A",0],["d","What a game!","B",0],["d","Another goal!","A",0],["d","Yes, Give me five!","B",0],["d","The Tigers are the best.","A",0],["d","Definitely!","B",0],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["p","Hand out playing cards and let the students do a quick little warm-up to refresh their use of numbers. Give out six cards to every student. Nobody may see anyone else's cards. You have to guess at what cards any player might have and ask him for it. If he has the card, he must surrender it. If he does not have the card, then can be the next to ask . For instance, the first player will ask, \"Benny, do you have the ten of diamonds?\", etc.","发扑克牌，让学生快速热身，复习数字的用法。每位学生发六张牌，谁都不能看别人的牌。你要猜某位玩家可能有什么牌并向他要，如果他有就必须交出；如果没有，就换他下一个问。例如第一位玩家问：\"Benny, do you have the ten of diamonds?\" 等。",0],["h2","Review for Quiz (25 mins)","小测验复习（25 分钟）",0],["p","Review the use of the sentences expressing future plans. Do the exercise using the digital medium (column on the right). Turn off the sound before doing the exercise. Click on the characters and let the students fill in the dialogue patterns. If they have any problems, turn on the sound and let them listen to the answers. The teacher would have to be quick enough to type in some of the answers as well so the students can see it in writing.","复习表达未来计划的句子用法。用数字教材做练习（见右栏）。做练习前先关掉声音，点击角色让学生填入对话句型。有问题的话就打开声音让他们听答案。老师也要动作够快，输入一些答案让学生看到文字。",0],["h3","Quiz Review","小测验复习",0],["p","Review for the test with the students. Have a copy of the test and go over each portion with them. Don't show them the test, but do other examples of the same type of questions the test is composed of. Make sure you cover the whole test.","和学生复习考试范围。拿一份考卷和他们逐部分讲评。不要让他们看考卷，而是做考卷中同类型题目的其他例子，确定涵盖整份考卷。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Get the students prepared for the quiz. Have them remove any unnecessary items from the desks. Hand out the quiz and let them do it.","让学生准备考试，请他们清掉桌上不需要的东西。发下考卷让他们作答。",0],["h2","Listening Lab( 20 mins)","听力练习（20 分钟）",0],["p","After they have completed the quiz, get them ready for listening so that they can do the listening quiz. Play the tape once or twice and have them write the answers down.","考完后，让他们准备做听力小测验。录音播一两次，让他们写下答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. Are you going to mail a letter tomorrow?","1. Are you going to mail a letter tomorrow?（你明天要寄信吗？）",0],["li","2. Are you going to see the doctor on Friday?","2. Are you going to see the doctor on Friday?（你星期五要去看医生吗？）",0],["li","3. Will you visit friends on Saturday?","3. Will you visit friends on Saturday?（你星期六会去拜访朋友吗？）",0],["li","4. How do you spell \"letter?\"","4. How do you spell \"letter?\"（\"letter\" 怎么拼？）",0],["li","5. Please say the first six months of the year.","5. 请说出一年的前六个月份。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[78],"b":[["h2","Test 3","第 3 次考试",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","CR/CA Review Review grammar","CR/CA 复习　复习语法",0],["h2","Warm up-Review for the Test (40 mins)","热身——考前复习（40 分钟）",0],["li","1. Check the 3rd Quiz first, the test will be almost the same with the quiz.","1. 先讲评第 3 次小测验，考试内容会和小测验差不多。",0],["li","2. Have a copy of the test with you. Do a quick review of all the areas, including the sentence patterns. Include vocabulary, spelling, and sentence patterns.","2. 手边准备一份考卷，快速复习所有范围，包括句型、单词和拼写。",0],["li","3. Choose any of the digital material suitable for revising the work. Turn the sound off and let the students provide the answers before you affirm it.","3. 选择任何适合复习的数字教材。关掉声音，让学生先说出答案，你再确认。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","Give enough time for students to do the test. If any of them finish early, give them an assignment to keep busy.","给学生足够的时间考试。如果有人提早写完，给他们一些作业让他们有事做。",0],["h2","Oral Test (3-5 mins per student)","口语测验 Oral Test（每位学生 3–5 分钟）",0],["p","Ask the students to take out their text books and review for the oral test. It's better to do the oral test outside of the classroom so other students won't hear the questions. Make sure you don't go too far away from your classroom so you can still keep an eye on your students. Call the students one by one to come out and take the oral test with you. The oral test should account for 20% of the test's total score. However, how many points each questions should be worth is your decision. You may choose to give some questions more points based on the difficulty of the question. The following is a sample of an oral test for your reference. It's also a good idea to come up with your own oral test since you know the students' strengths and weaknesses.","请学生拿出课本准备口语测验。最好在教室外进行口语测验，以免其他学生听到题目；但不要离教室太远，才能随时注意学生。一个一个叫学生出来和您进行口语测验。口语测验占测验总分的 20%，但每题配分由您决定，可以依题目难易给某些题目较高的分数。以下口语测验范例仅供参考；您最了解学生的强项和弱点，自己设计口语测验也是很好的做法。口语测验题目：",0],["h2","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. (turn to Lesson 9) Are the balls on the chair?","1.（翻到第 9 课）Are the balls on the chair?",0],["li","2. Is the bird in the clock?",null,0],["li","3. Is the pencil on the desk?","3. Is the pencil on the desk?（铅笔在桌上吗？）",0],["li","4. Are Mike's eyes blue?",null,0],["li","5. Who is busy?",null,0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write down the quiz and listening grade in their report book and ask them to get signatures from their parents. Also ask them to write corrections 5-10 times for every mistake they've made in the two quizzes.","(1) 把小测验和听力成绩写在学习进度手册上，请学生带回家给家长签名。也请学生把两次小测验中每个错误的订正写 5–10 次。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":100},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[79,80],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","To correct Test 3","订正第 3 次考试",1],["p","To prepare \"PTA\" Activity Sheet No.7","准备“家长会”　活动单 7",1],["h2","Teaching procedures (30 mins)","教学程序（30 分钟）",0],["p","Go over the test correcting mistakes and pointing out common errors.","讲评考卷，订正错误并指出常见错误。",0],["h3","Activity Sheet No.7","活动单 7",0],["h2","PTA preparation (30 mins)","家长会准备（30 分钟）",0],["p","It is the big day! Take time to rehearse for the ceremony.","今天是大日子！花时间彩排典礼。",0],["li","1. Song. Start out by letting the students sing a song, any song they may have learned in the class.","1. 唱歌。一开始先让学生唱一首歌，任何在课堂上学过的歌都可以。",0],["li","2. Game/Competition. Volleyball would be a good game to play during this part. Make a paper ball and divide the class into two teams. Anyone who catches the ball says an English word before throwing it to the opposite team. No word may be repeated twice. If a word is wrong the student sit down. See which team has the most standing members left.","2. 游戏／比赛。这个部分很适合玩排球游戏。做一颗纸球，把全班分成两队。接到球的人要先说一个英文单词，再把球丢给对方队伍。同一个字不能重复说。说错字的学生要坐下。看哪一队站着的人最多。",0],["li","3. Role Play. Below is the script for the roleplay. Go over it once, perhaps. See that all the props are in order.","3. 角色扮演。下面是角色扮演的剧本，或许先顺过一遍，确认所有道具都准备好了。",0],["h2","Play (30 mins)","演出（30 分钟）",0],["p","The children are on a school picnic today. They are at the Zoo. They can see many animals. The conversation is as follows:","孩子们今天学校郊游，他们在动物园，可以看到很多动物。对话如下：",0],["p","(Names can be replaced with that of students in the class.)","（名字可以换成班上学生的名字。）",0],["d","Number one.","Narrator",0],["d","I can see a monkey. What can you see, Mary?","Amy",0],["d","I can see a lion. But it is a baby.","Mary",0],["p","Amy Oh, a baby? How old is it?","Amy　噢，一只小宝宝？它几岁？",0],["d","It is very young. What can you see, Eddy?","Mary",0],["d","I can see a green snake. What can you see, Billy?","Eddy",0],["d","I can see a big cat.","Billy",0],["d","No, it's not a cat. It's a tiger. What can you see Danny?","Eddy",0],["p","I can see a very big animal. It's an elephant.","我看到一只很大的动物，是大象。",0],["d","I can see Miss Wang. Hello Miss Wang! Miss Wang, what can a dolphin do?","Billy",0],["d","A dolphin can swim, Billy... Yes Annie?","Miss Wang",0],["d","What can birds do ?","Annie",0],["d","A bird can fly...Yes Andrew?","Miss Wang",0],["d","Can an elephant climb a tree?","Andrew",0],["d","no, a monkey can climb a tree. Did you see a tiger today?","Miss Wang",0],["d","Yes, I did. I saw a tiger.","Eddy",0],["d","Tigers can run very fast. Tell me, what can children do?","Miss Wang",0],["p","Billy and Amy: We can run, swim, and talk.","Billy 和 Amy：我们会跑、会游泳、会说话。",0],["h2","The graduation ceremony (10mins)","结业典礼（10 分钟）",0],["p","Let the students move to the graduation area in orderly fashion. Have the awards ceremony and congratulate the students after they came to the front to receive their award. Shake their hands and spend some time talking to the parents. Reinforcement","让学生有秩序地移动到结业典礼区。举行颁奖典礼，学生上前领奖后恭喜他们，和他们握手，并花点时间和家长聊聊。加强",0],["li","1. Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","2. Review all the lessons the students have done using their books.","2. 用课本复习学生上过的所有课程。",0],["li","3. Do some review of the lesson materials using the digital medium Homework exercises Take the time to preview the homework. Progress Report Book Write the main learning items on the board and let the students write it in their books.","3. 用数字教材复习一些课程内容。家庭作业：花时间预习作业。进度报告本：把主要学习项目写在白板上，让学生写进本子。",0],["h2","Telephone teaching Material. 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["li","1. Do you like puppies?","1. Do you like puppies?（你喜欢小狗吗？）",0],["li","2. What do you want?","2. What do you want?（你想要什么？）",0],["li","3. Please say the last six months of the year.","3. Please say the last six months of the year.（请说出一年的后六个月份。）",0],["li","4. What month comes after April?","4. What month comes after April?（四月之后是几月？）",0],["li","5. Are you going to mail a letter on Thursday?","5. Are you going to mail a letter on Thursday?（你星期四要寄信吗？）",0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[6,["None"]],[32,["None"]],[32,["None"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[81,82,83,84,85],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法／发音总整理","t":"Grammar/Phonics Summaries","k":"img","p":[86],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answers","k":"img","p":[87],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];